ENTS\"><p class=\"post-toc-title\">ARTICLE CONTENTS</p><ol class=\"post-toc-list\"><li><a href=\"#post-section-1\">Barcode setup</a></li><li><a href=\"#post-section-2\">Create an inbound request</a></li><li><a href=\"#post-section-3\">Receiving and inspection</a></li><li><a href=\"#post-section-4\">Fulfillment and shipping</a></li></ol></nav>\r\n\r\n          <!-- Section 1 -->\r\n          <div class=\"post-content-block\">\r\n            <h2 class=\"post-content-h2\" id=\"post-section-1\">Barcode setup</h2>\r\n            <p class=\"post-content-p\">\r\n              Create or assign a barcode for each product. SpeeGo provides barcode files on request.\r\n            </p>\r\n          </div>\r\n\r\n          <!-- Section 2 -->\r\n          <div class=\"post-content-block\">\r\n            <h2 class=\"post-content-h2\" id=\"post-section-2\">Create an inbound request</h2>\r\n            <p class=\"post-content-p\">\r\n              Select your SKUs and quantities. The OMS confirms the request and returns an IR code; print it and attach it to your packages before shipping.\r\n            </p>\r\n          </div>\r\n\r\n          <!-- Section 3 -->\r\n          <div class=\"post-content-block\">\r\n            <h2 class=\"post-content-h2\" id=\"post-section-3\">Receiving and inspection</h2>\r\n            <p class=\"post-content-p\">\r\n              Shipments are inspected before storage. Inventory is updated in the OMS for sellers to monitor.\r\n            </p>\r\n          </div>\r\n\r\n          <!-- Section 4 -->\r\n          <div class=\"post-content-block\">\r\n            <h2 class=\"post-content-h2\" id=\"post-section-4\">Fulfillment and shipping</h2>\r\n            <p class=\"post-content-p\">\r\n              Orders are packed with video documentation and shipped through USPS, UPS, or FedEx, depending on requirements.\r\n            </p>\r\n          </div>\r\n\r\n          <!-- Author Bio -->\r\n          <div class=\"post-author-bio\">\r\n            <di