badge\">EN</span></div>\r\n              <h3 class=\"featured-title\">Launching a Cosmetics Brand: From Idea to Global Market with SpeeGo Logistics</h3>\r\n              <p class=\"featured-desc\">\r\n                Hành trình đưa một thương hiệu mỹ phẩm từ ý tưởng ra thị trường quốc tế, cùng hỗ trợ sản xuất và logistics.\r\n              </p>\r\n              <div>\r\n                <a href=\"https://speegologistic.com/khoi-nghiep-thuong-hieu-my-pham-tu-y-tuong-den-thi-truong-toan-cau-voi-speego-logistics/\" class=\"featured-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Đọc trên speegologistic.com ↗</a>\r\n              </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- CỘT PHẢI (~40%): BOX TÀI LIỆU CỐT LÕI -->\r\n        <div class=\"featured-sidebar\">\r\n          <div class=\"core-docs-box\">\r\n            <h4 class=\"core-docs-title\">Tài liệu cốt lõi</h4>\r\n            <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;\">\r\n              <a href=\"https://speegologistic.com/toan-canh-san-xuat-va-xuat-khau-san-pham-nail-di-my-canada-uc/\" class=\"core-docs-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\r\n                Nail Products for the US, Canada &amp; Australia: Manufacturing, Export &amp; Supply Chain Insights ↗\r\n              </a>\r\n              <a href=\"https://speegologistic.com/san-xuat-va-xuat-khau-san-pham-nail-di-my-canada-uc-giai-phap-tron-goi-cho-doanh-nghiep-nganh-nail/\" class=\"core-docs-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\r\n                Nail Product Manufacturing and Export to the US, Canada &amp; Australia ↗\r\n              </a>\r\n              <a href=\"https://speegologistic.com/khoi-nghiep-thuong-hieu-my-pham-tu-y-tuong-den-thi-truong-toan-cau-voi-speego-logistics/\" class=\"core-docs-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\r\n                Launching a Cosmetics Brand: From Idea to Global Market with SpeeGo Logistics ↗\r\n              </a>\r\n            </div>\r