tured-link\">Read on speegologistic.com ↗</a>\r\n              </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- RIGHT COLUMN (~40%): SIDEBAR CTA FORM + CORE RESOURCES -->\r\n        <div class=\"featured-sidebar\">\r\n          <div data-component=\"cta-form\" data-variant=\"sidebar\" data-tag=\"LET&apos;S MOVE FORWARD\" data-heading=\"Need expert advice?\" data-subtext=\"Tell us about your products and business plans. SpeeGo will help you find the right solution.\" data-phone=\"(+84) 906 828 898 ↗\">\r\n          </div>\r\n\r\n          <div class=\"core-docs-box\">\r\n            <h4 class=\"core-docs-title\">Core resources</h4>\r\n            <div style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;gap: 10px\">\r\n              <a href=\"#/en/import-export-news\" class=\"core-docs-link\">\r\n                Restricted Ingredients in Canada Cosmetics ↗\r\n              </a>\r\n              <a href=\"#/en/import-export-news\" class=\"core-docs-link\">\r\n                Import Cosmetics to the United States: FDA Regulations, Costs &amp; Requirements ↗\r\n              </a>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <!-- 4. BOTTOM SECTION: EXPLORE MORE -->\r\n  <section class=\"categories-explore-section\">\r\n    <div class=\"container\">\r\n      <span class=\"section-tag\">EXPLORE MORE</span>\r\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">Other topics</h2>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"pills-filter-row\" id=\"categoryPillsRow\">\r\n        <a href=\"#/en/knowledge\" class=\"pill-btn\">\r\n          All topics <span class=\"pill-count\">9</span>\r\n        </a>\r\n        <a href=\"#/en/shipping-guides\" class=\"pill-btn\">\r\n          Shipping guides <span class=\"pill-count\">1</span>\r\n        </a>\r\n        <a href=\"#/en/industry-guides\" class=\"pill-btn\">\r\n          Industry guides <span class=\"pill-count\">3</span>\r\n        </a>\r\n        <a href=\"#/en/