o cho khách hàng</a></li></ol></nav>\r\n\r\n          <!-- Section 1 -->\r\n          <div class=\"post-content-block\">\r\n            <h2 class=\"post-content-h2\" id=\"post-section-1\">Trước khi sản xuất</h2>\r\n            <p class=\"post-content-p\">\r\n              Kiểm tra nguyên vật liệu và quy trình theo yêu cầu đã thống nhất.\r\n            </p>\r\n          </div>\r\n\r\n          <!-- Section 2 -->\r\n          <div class=\"post-content-block\">\r\n            <h2 class=\"post-content-h2\" id=\"post-section-2\">Trong quá trình sản xuất</h2>\r\n            <p class=\"post-content-p\">\r\n              Theo dõi và phát hiện lỗi sớm để giảm chi phí khắc phục.\r\n            </p>\r\n          </div>\r\n\r\n          <!-- Section 3 -->\r\n          <div class=\"post-content-block\">\r\n            <h2 class=\"post-content-h2\" id=\"post-section-3\">Trước khi xuất hàng</h2>\r\n            <p class=\"post-content-p\">\r\n              Đánh giá sản phẩm trước khi đóng gói và giao đi.\r\n            </p>\r\n          </div>\r\n\r\n          <!-- Section 4 -->\r\n          <div class=\"post-content-block\">\r\n            <h2 class=\"post-content-h2\" id=\"post-section-4\">Báo cáo cho khách hàng</h2>\r\n            <p class=\"post-content-p\">\r\n              Kết quả kiểm tra có thể bao gồm mẫu sản phẩm, hình ảnh, video, báo cáo chi tiết và danh sách lỗi nếu có.\r\n            </p>\r\n          </div>\r\n\r\n          <!-- Author Bio -->\r\n          <div class=\"post-author-bio\">\r\n            <div class=\"post-author-avatar\">SG</div>\r\n            <div class=\"post-author-info\">\r\n              <h4 class=\"post-author-name\">Ban biên tập SpeeGo</h4>\r\n              <p class=\"post-author-role\">Chia sẻ thông tin về dịch vụ sourcing, vận chuyển và fulfillment của SpeeGo Logistics.</p>\r\n              <div class=\"post-author-links\" aria-label=\"Author links\"><a href=\"https://speegologistic.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Website\" title=\"Website\">W</a><a href=\"mailto:info@speegologistic.com\" aria-label=\"Email\" title=\"Email\">@</a><span class=\"post-author-social-disabled\" aria-label=\"Chưa có hồ sơ LinkedIn\" title=\"Chưa có hồ sơ LinkedIn\">in</span><span class=\"post-author-social-disabled\" aria-label=\"Chưa có hồ sơ Facebook\" title=\"Chưa có hồ sơ Facebook\">f</span></div>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n\r\n        <!-- CỘT PHẢI (~35%): SIDEBAR FORM + BÀI VIẾT QUAN TRỌNG -->\r\n        <aside class=\"post-sidebar\">\r\n          <!-- Box Bài viết quan trọng của chủ đề -->\r\n          <div class=\"topic-key-articles-card\">\r\n            <h4 class=\"topic-key-title\">Bài viết quan trọng của chủ đề</h4>\r\n            <div class=\"topic-key-list\">\r\n              <div class=\"topic-key-item\">\r\n                <a href=\"#/knowledge/sourcing-qc\">\r\n                  Top 05 Vietnam Sourcing Agents for Reliable Import &amp; Manufacturing ↗\r\n                </a>\r\n              </div>\r\n              <div class=\"topic-key-item\">\r\n                <a href=\"#/knowledge/quy-trinh-nhap-kho\">\r\n                  Từ barcode đến nhập kho: quy trình Fulfillment tại SpeeGo ↗\r\n                </a>\r\n              </div>\r\n              <div class=\"topic-key-item\">\r\n                <a href=\"#/knowledge/chuan-bi-lo-hang\">\r\n                  Chuẩn bị lô hàng: bắt đầu từ những thông tin nào? ↗\r\n                </a>\r\n              </div>\r\n              <div class=\"topic-key-item\" style=\"margin-top: 6px; padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #F1F5F9;\">\r\n                <a href=\"#/knowledge/sourcing-qc\" class=\"topic-more-link\">\r\n                  Xem tất cả bài viết chuyên mục · Sourcing &amp; QC ↗\r\n                </a>\r\n              </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n\r\n          <!-- Ask question form -->\r\n          <div data-component=\"cta-form\"\r\n               data-variant=\"sidebar\"\r\n               data-tag=\"HỎI SPEEGO\"\r\n               data-heading=\"Gửi câu hỏi cho SpeeGo\"\r\n               data-subtext=\"Bạn cần tư vấn vận chuyển, sourcing hay fulfillment? Để lại thông tin, SpeeGo sẽ phản hồi sớm.\"\r\n               data-phone=\"(+84) 906 828 898 ↗\">\r\n          </div>\r\n        </aside>\r\n\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n','[Bài viết] QC theo từng giai đoạn: kiểm soát chất lượng trước khi xuất hàng','','inherit','closed','closed','','24-revision-v1','','','2026-09-26 14:15:12','2026-09-26 14:15:12','',24,'http://localhost/wordpress_demo/?p=272',0,'revision','',0),(273,0,'2026-09-26 14:15:12','2026-09-26 14:15:12','\r\n\r\n<div class=\"page-container page-sourcing\"\r\n     data-page=\"sourcing\"\r\n     data-nav=\"sourcing\"\r\n     data-breadcrumb=\'[{\"label\":\"Home\",\"href\":\"#/en/sourcing\"},{\"label\":\"Sourcing & quality control\",\"href\":\"#/en/sourcing\"}]\'>\r\n\r\n  <!-- 1. HERO SECTION -->\r\n  <section class=\"page-hero-2col sourcing-hero-section\">\r\n    <div class=\"container\">\r\n      <div class=\"hero-2col-grid\">\r\n        <!-- Cột trái: Tiêu đề, giới thiệu & nút hành động -->\r\n        <div class=\"hero-2col-left\">\r\n          <div class=\"hero-tag-bar\">SOURCING &amp; QUALITY CONTROL</div>\r\n          <h1 class=\"hero-h1-clean\">\r\n            Comprehensive sourcing<br>\r\n            <span class=\"text-orange\">and quality control.</span>\r\n          </h1>\r\n          <p class=\"hero-desc-clean\">\r\n            SpeeGo helps businesses find suitable manufacturers, verify factory capabilities, negotiate partnership terms, and check product quality before factory release.\r\n          </p>\r\n          <div class=\"hero-actions-row\">\r\n            <a href=\"#contact-form\" class=\"btn-orange\">\r\n              Talk to us ↗\r\n            </a>\r\n            <a href=\"tel:+84906828898\" class=\"hero-phone-label\">\r\n              (+84) 906 828 898\r\n            </a>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Cột phải: Ảnh kho bãi kệ pallet xanh-cam SpeeGo -->\r\n        <div class=\"hero-2col-right\">\r\n          <div class=\"hero-img-card-wrap\">\r\n            <img src=\"assets/warehouse_racks_hero.jpg\" alt=\"From the factory to global markets\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; this.src=\'assets/warehouse_hero.jpg\';\">\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <!-- Orange ticker ribbon -->\r\n  <div class=\"ff-ticker-orange-wrap sourcing-ticker-orange\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\r\n    <div class=\"ff-ticker-orange-inner\">\r\n      <span>GLOBAL SOURCING</span><span class=\"ff-ticker-symbol\">✦</span>\r\n      <span>QUALITY CONTROL</span><span class=\"ff-ticker-symbol\">✦</span>\r\n      <span>INTERNATIONAL LOGISTICS</span><span class=\"ff-ticker-symbol\">✦</span>\r\n      <span>FULFILLMENT</span><span class=\"ff-ticker-symbol\">✦</span>\r\n      <span>SUPPLY CHAIN SOLUTIONS</span><span class=\"ff-ticker-symbol\">✦</span>\r\n      <span>GLOBAL SOURCING</span><span class=\"ff-ticker-symbol\">✦</span>\r\n      <span>QUALITY CONTROL</span><span class=\"ff-ticker-symbol\">✦</span>\r\n      <span>INTERNATIONAL LOGISTICS</span><span class=\"ff-ticker-symbol\">✦</span>\r\n      <span>FULFILLMENT</span><span class=\"ff-ticker-symbol\">✦</span>\r\n      <span>SUPPLY CHAIN SOLUTIONS</span><span class=\"ff-ticker-symbol\">✦</span>\r\n      <span>GLOBAL SOURCING</span><span class=\"ff-ticker-symbol\">✦</span>\r\n      <span>QUALITY CONTROL</span><span class=\"ff-ticker-symbol\">✦</span>\r\n      <span>INTERNATIONAL LOGISTICS</span><span class=\"ff-ticker-symbol\">✦</span>\r\n      <span>FULFILLMENT</span><span class=\"ff-ticker-symbol\">✦</span>\r\n      <span>SUPPLY CHAIN SOLUTIONS</span><span class=\"ff-ticker-symbol\">✦</span>\r\n      <span>GLOBAL SOURCING</span><span class=\"ff-ticker-symbol\">✦</span>\r\n      <span>QUALITY CONTROL</span><span class=\"ff-ticker-symbol\">✦</span>\r\n      <span>INTERNATIONAL LOGISTICS</span><span class=\"ff-ticker-symbol\">✦</span>\r\n      <span>FULFILLMENT</span><span class=\"ff-ticker-symbol\">✦</span>\r\n      <span>SUPPLY CHAIN SOLUTIONS</span><span class=\"ff-ticker-symbol\">✦</span>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <!-- 2. INDUSTRIES (5 CARDS GRID) -->\r\n  <section class=\"industries-section\" id=\"industries\">\r\n    <div class=\"container\">\r\n      <div class=\"section-header industries-section-header\">\r\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\">\r\n          Know the product.<br>\r\n          Match the right factory.\r\n        </h2>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"industries-cards-grid\">\r\n        <!-- Card 1: Cosmetics -->\r\n        <div class=\"industry-card-item\">\r\n          <div class=\"industry-icon-box\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\r\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\r\n              <path d=\"M9 3h6v3H9z\"></path>\r\n              <path d=\"M10 6v3h4V6\"></path>\r\n              <rect x=\"6\" y=\"9\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" rx=\"3\"></rect>\r\n              <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"15\" r=\"2\"></circle>\r\n            </svg>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <h3 class=\"industry-card-title\">Cosmetics</h3>\r\n          <p class=\"industry-card-desc\">End-to-end cosmetics solutions, from sourcing and production to shipping.</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Card 2: Nails -->\r\n        <div class=\"industry-card-item\">\r\n          <div class=\"industry-icon-box\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\r\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\r\n              <path d=\"M10 2h4v5h-4z\"></path>\r\n              <rect x=\"7\" y=\"7\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" rx=\"3\"></rect>\r\n              <line x1=\"12\" y1=\"11\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"17\"></line>\r\n            </svg>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <h3 class=\"industry-card-title\">Nails</h3>\r\n          <p class=\"industry-card-desc\">Wholesale sourcing, manufacturing, and procurement of quality nail materials, tools, and accessories.</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Card 3: Decor & furniture -->\r\n        <div class=\"industry-card-item\">\r\n          <div class=\"industry-icon-box\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\r\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\r\n              <path d=\"M6 19v2M18 19v2\"></path>\r\n              <path d=\"M4 11a3 3 0 0 1 3-3h10a3 3 0 0 1 3 3v5H4v-5z\"></path>\r\n              <path d=\"M4 16h16\"></path>\r\n            </svg>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <h3 class=\"industry-card-title\">Decor &amp; furniture</h3>\r\n          <p class=\"industry-card-desc\">Furniture and decor for shops, nail salons, spas, restaurants, homes, and workplaces.</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Card 4: Handicrafts -->\r\n        <div class=\"industry-card-item\">\r\n          <div class=\"industry-icon-box\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\r\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\r\n              <path d=\"M12 2a4 4 0 0 0-4 4c0 3 4 7 4 7s4-4 4-7a4 4 0 0 0-4-4z\"></path>\r\n              <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"18\" r=\"3\"></circle>\r\n            </svg>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <h3 class=\"industry-card-title\">Handicrafts</h3>\r\n          <p class=\"industry-card-desc\">Handicrafts that reflect traditional cultural craftsmanship.</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Card 5: Technical equipment -->\r\n        <div class=\"industry-card-item\">\r\n          <div class=\"industry-icon-box\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\r\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\r\n              <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"></circle>\r\n              <path d=\"M12 2v2M12 20v2M4.93 4.93l1.41 1.41M17.66 17.66l1.41 1.41M2 12h2M20 12h2M6.34 17.66l-1.41 1.41M19.07 4.93l-1.41 1.41\"></path>\r\n            </svg>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <h3 class=\"industry-card-title\">Technical equipment</h3>\r\n          <p class=\"industry-card-desc\">Talk to SpeeGo about a solution that fits your business requirements.</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"industry-action-btn-row\">\r\n        <a href=\"#contact-form\" class=\"btn-orange industry-cta-btn\">\r\n          Discuss your product category ↗\r\n        </a>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <!-- 4. MANUFACTURING MODELS (3 LARGE IMAGE CARDS) -->\r\n  <section class=\"models-section\" id=\"manufacturing-models\">\r\n    <div class=\"container\">\r\n      <div class=\"section-header\">\r\n        <span class=\"section-tag\">MANUFACTURING MODELS</span>\r\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\">\r\n          Three routes to<br>\r\n          getting a product made.\r\n        </h2>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"models-3col-grid\">\r\n        <!-- Model OEM -->\r\n        <div class=\"model-img-card\">\r\n          <img src=\"assets/warehouse_racks_hero.jpg\" alt=\"OEM Model\" class=\"model-bg-img\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; this.src=\'assets/warehouse_hero.jpg\';\">\r\n          <div class=\"model-gradient-overlay\"></div>\r\n          <div class=\"model-card-content\">\r\n            <h3 class=\"model-title-h3\">OEM</h3>\r\n            <div class=\"model-sub-badge\">ORIGINAL EQUIPMENT MANUFACTURING</div>\r\n            <p class=\"model-body-text\">The factory manufactures to the design, formula, and specifications you provide.</p>\r\n            <div class=\"model-pills-row\">\r\n              <span class=\"model-pill-tag\">Your design</span>\r\n              <span class=\"model-pill-tag\">Full customisation</span>\r\n              <span class=\"model-pill-tag\">Higher MOQ</span>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Model ODM -->\r\n        <div class=\"model-img-card\">\r\n          <img src=\"assets/port_sunset_hero.jpg\" alt=\"ODM Model\" class=\"model-bg-img\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; this.src=\'assets/warehouse_hero.jpg\';\">\r\n          <div class=\"model-gradient-overlay\"></div>\r\n          <div class=\"model-card-content\">\r\n            <h3 class=\"model-title-h3\">ODM</h3>\r\n            <div class=\"model-sub-badge\">ORIGINAL DESIGN MANUFACTURING</div>\r\n            <p class=\"model-body-text\">Start from the factory\'s existing designs and formulas, adjust them, then brand the result as your own.</p>\r\n            <div class=\"model-pills-row\">\r\n              <span class=\"model-pill-tag\">Ready designs</span>\r\n              <span class=\"model-pill-tag\">Moderate customisation</span>\r\n              <span class=\"model-pill-tag\">Faster to market</span>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Model Private Label -->\r\n        <div class=\"model-img-card\">\r\n          <img src=\"assets/card_hand_device.jpg\" alt=\"Private Label Model\" class=\"model-bg-img\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; this.src=\'assets/warehouse_hero.jpg\';\">\r\n          <div class=\"model-gradient-overlay\"></div>\r\n          <div class=\"model-card-content\">\r\n            <h3 class=\"model-title-h3\">Private Label</h3>\r\n            <div class=\"model-sub-badge\">NHÃN RIÊNG THƯƠNG HIỆU · OWN-BRAND LABELLING</div>\r\n            <p class=\"model-body-text\">The factory\'s existing product, finished with your own label and packaging.</p>\r\n            <div class=\"model-pills-row\">\r\n              <span class=\"model-pill-tag\">Own label</span>\r\n              <span class=\"model-pill-tag\">Lower MOQ</span>\r\n              <span class=\"model-pill-tag\">Quickest launch</span>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <p class=\"ff-section-sub\" style=\"font-size: 0.84rem; color: #94A3B8; margin-top: 18px;\">\r\n        Placeholder imagery — to be replaced with photographs for each model.\r\n      </p>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <!-- 6. QUALITY CONTROL WORKFLOW (same pattern as Fulfillment process) -->\r\n  <section class=\"ff-process-section sourcing-process-section\" id=\"quality-control\">\r\n    <div class=\"container\">\r\n      <div class=\"ff-section-header\">\r\n        <span class=\"ff-tag-eyebrow ff-tag-light\">QUALITY CONTROL</span>\r\n        <h2 class=\"ff-section-title ff-title-white\">Quality checked at every stage.</h2>\r\n        <p class=\"ff-section-sub sourcing-process-sub\">\r\n          One continuous flow from raw materials to the QC file handed to the customer.\r\n        </p>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"ff-steps-grid sourcing-qc-steps-grid\">\r\n        <div class=\"ff-step-item\">\r\n          <div class=\"ff-step-num\">01</div>\r\n          <h3 class=\"ff-step-name\">Pre-production inspection</h3>\r\n          <p class=\"ff-step-text\">Check that materials and processes meet your requirements.</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div class=\"ff-step-item\">\r\n          <div class=\"ff-step-num\">02</div>\r\n          <h3 class=\"ff-step-name\">During-production inspection</h3>\r\n          <p class=\"ff-step-text\">Identify defects early to reduce the cost of corrective action.</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div class=\"ff-step-item\">\r\n          <div class=\"ff-step-num\">03</div>\r\n          <h3 class=\"ff-step-name\">Pre-shipment inspection</h3>\r\n          <p class=\"ff-step-text\">Assess products before packing and dispatch.</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div class=\"ff-step-item\">\r\n          <div class=\"ff-step-num\">04</div>\r\n          <h3 class=\"ff-step-name\">QC reporting</h3>\r\n          <p class=\"ff-step-text\">Samples, photos, videos, detailed reports, and a defect list where applicable.</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"ff-process-cta\">\r\n        <a href=\"#contact-form\" class=\"btn-orange\">\r\n          Discuss quality control ↗\r\n        </a>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <!-- 5. WHY SPEEGO (6 CARDS GRID) -->\r\n  <section class=\"ie-why-section\" id=\"why-speego\">\r\n    <div class=\"container\">\r\n      <div class=\"section-header\">\r\n        <span class=\"section-tag\">WHY SPEEGO</span>\r\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\">\r\n          Comprehensive sourcing<br>\r\n          and quality control.\r\n        </h2>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"ie-why-grid\">\r\n        <!-- Card 01 -->\r\n        <div class=\"ie-service-card\">\r\n          <div class=\"ie-badge-box\">01</div>\r\n          <h3 class=\"ie-card-h3\">An extensive partner network</h3>\r\n          <p class=\"ie-card-body\">SpeeGo combines a dedicated sourcing team with a partner network across a wide range of industries.</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Card 02 -->\r\n        <div class=\"ie-service-card\">\r\n          <div class=\"ie-badge-box\">02</div>\r\n          <h3 class=\"ie-card-h3\">Thorough factory assessments</h3>\r\n          <p class=\"ie-card-body\">We assess production capabilities to identify the right factory for each customer.</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Card 03 -->\r\n        <div class=\"ie-service-card\">\r\n          <div class=\"ie-badge-box\">03</div>\r\n          <h3 class=\"ie-card-h3\">Competitive pricing and suitable MOQs</h3>\r\n          <p class=\"ie-card-body\">We help negotiate pricing and minimum order quantities that fit your needs.</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Card 04 -->\r\n        <div class=\"ie-service-card\">\r\n          <div class=\"ie-badge-box\">04</div>\r\n          <h3 class=\"ie-card-h3\">Production monitoring and updates</h3>\r\n          <p class=\"ie-card-body\">Stay informed with regular photos, videos, product samples, and production progress updates.</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Card 05 -->\r\n        <div class=\"ie-service-card\">\r\n          <div class=\"ie-badge-box\">05</div>\r\n          <h3 class=\"ie-card-h3\">Quality inspection (QC)</h3>\r\n          <p class=\"ie-card-body\">Product inspections help ensure finished goods meet the required quality standards.</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Card 06 -->\r\n        <div class=\"ie-service-card\">\r\n          <div class=\"ie-badge-box\">06</div>\r\n          <h3 class=\"ie-card-h3\">Shipping and fulfillment when needed</h3>\r\n          <p class=\"ie-card-body\">Combine international freight with fulfillment and warehousing services as your business requires.</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <!-- 7. PHOTOS & VIDEO (SEE THE PRODUCTION FLOOR) -->\r\n  <section class=\"prod-floor-section\">\r\n    <div class=\"container\">\r\n      <div class=\"prod-floor-header\">\r\n        <div>\r\n          <span class=\"section-tag\">PHOTOS &amp; VIDEO</span>\r\n          <h2 class=\"section-title\">See the production floor.</h2>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div class=\"prod-arrows-nav\">\r\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"prod-arrow-btn\" onclick=\"slideProdFloor(-1)\" aria-label=\"Previous slide\">←</button>\r\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"prod-arrow-btn\" onclick=\"slideProdFloor(1)\" aria-label=\"Next slide\">→</button>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"prod-slider-viewport\">\r\n        <div class=\"prod-slider-track\" id=\"prodSliderTrack\">\r\n          <!-- Page 1 (Cards 1 - 3) -->\r\n          <div class=\"prod-slide-page\">\r\n            <div class=\"prod-cards-grid\">\r\n              <!-- Card 1: Video -->\r\n              <div class=\"prod-card-item\">\r\n                <div class=\"prod-card-media\">\r\n                  <img src=\"assets/warehouse_racks_hero.jpg\" alt=\"QC on the factory floor\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; this.src=\'assets/warehouse_hero.jpg\';\">\r\n                  <div class=\"prod-media-badge prod-badge-video\">\r\n                    <span>VIDEO</span> · <span>Video coming soon</span>\r\n                  </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <div class=\"prod-card-body\">\r\n                  <h3 class=\"prod-card-title\">QC on the factory floor</h3>\r\n                  <p class=\"prod-card-desc\">Video of the inspection steps before goods leave the factory.</p>\r\n                </div>\r\n              </div>\r\n\r\n              <!-- Card 2: Photo -->\r\n              <div class=\"prod-card-item\">\r\n                <div class=\"prod-card-media\">\r\n                  <img src=\"assets/port_sunset_hero.jpg\" alt=\"Partner production floor\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; this.src=\'assets/warehouse_hero.jpg\';\">\r\n                  <div class=\"prod-media-badge prod-badge-photo\">\r\n                    <span>PHOTO</span>\r\n                  </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <div class=\"prod-card-body\">\r\n                  <h3 class=\"prod-card-title\">Partner production floor</h3>\r\n                  <p class=\"prod-card-desc\">A production line inside the SpeeGo partner network.</p>\r\n                </div>\r\n              </div>\r\n\r\n              <!-- Card 3: Photo -->\r\n              <div class=\"prod-card-item\">\r\n                <div class=\"prod-card-media\">\r\n                  <img src=\"assets/warehouse_hero.jpg\" alt=\"Counting &amp; packing\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; this.src=\'assets/warehouse_racks_hero.jpg\';\">\r\n                  <div class=\"prod-media-badge prod-badge-photo\">\r\n                    <span>PHOTO</span>\r\n                  </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <div class=\"prod-card-body\">\r\n                  <h3 class=\"prod-card-title\">Counting &amp; packing</h3>\r\n                  <p class=\"prod-card-desc\">Verifying quantities and packing specs before dispatch.</p>\r\n                </div>\r\n              </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n\r\n          <!-- Page 2 (Cards 4 - 6: 3 High-Tech Manufacturing Photos) -->\r\n          <div class=\"prod-slide-page\">\r\n            <div class=\"prod-cards-grid\">\r\n              <!-- Card 4: Automated Assembly Line -->\r\n              <div class=\"prod-card-item\">\r\n                <div class=\"prod-card-media\">\r\n                  <img src=\"assets/factory_assembly_line.jpg\" alt=\"Automated assembly line\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; this.src=\'assets/warehouse_racks_hero.jpg\';\">\r\n                  <div class=\"prod-media-badge prod-badge-photo\">\r\n                    <span>PHOTO</span>\r\n                  </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <div class=\"prod-card-body\">\r\n                  <h3 class=\"prod-card-title\">Automated assembly line</h3>\r\n                  <p class=\"prod-card-desc\">Robotic assembly with precision quality inspection at every station.</p>\r\n                </div>\r\n              </div>\r\n\r\n              <!-- Card 5: Cleanroom Bottling & Packaging -->\r\n              <div class=\"prod-card-item\">\r\n                <div class=\"prod-card-media\">\r\n                  <img src=\"assets/factory_packaging_qc.jpg\" alt=\"Cleanroom bottling &amp; packaging\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; this.src=\'assets/port_sunset_hero.jpg\';\">\r\n                  <div class=\"prod-media-badge prod-badge-photo\">\r\n                    <span>PHOTO</span>\r\n                  </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <div class=\"prod-card-body\">\r\n                  <h3 class=\"prod-card-title\">Cleanroom bottling &amp; packaging</h3>\r\n                  <p class=\"prod-card-desc\">Cosmetics lines adhering strictly to hygiene and fill-level standards.</p>\r\n                </div>\r\n              </div>\r\n\r\n              <!-- Card 6: Staging & Barcode Dispatch -->\r\n              <div class=\"prod-card-item\">\r\n                <div class=\"prod-card-media\">\r\n                  <img src=\"assets/factory_staging_dispatch.jpg\" alt=\"Staging &amp; barcode dispatch\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; this.src=\'assets/warehouse_hero.jpg\';\">\r\n                  <div class=\"prod-media-badge prod-badge-photo\">\r\n                    <span>PHOTO</span>\r\n                  </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n                <div class=\"prod-card-body\">\r\n                  <h3 class=\"prod-card-title\">Staging &amp; barcode dispatch</h3>\r\n                  <p class=\"prod-card-desc\">Pallet shrink-wrapping and barcode verification before international dispatch.</p>\r\n                </div>\r\n              </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"ff-slider-dots\" style=\"margin-top: 24px; justify-content: center;\">\r\n        <span class=\"ff-dot active\" onclick=\"setSlide(0)\"></span>\r\n        <span class=\"ff-dot\" onclick=\"setSlide(1)\"></span>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n    </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <!-- 8. FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS (FAQ ACCORDION) -->\r\n  <section class=\"ff-faq-section\" style=\"background: #F8FAFC;\">\r\n    <div class=\"container\">\r\n      <div class=\"section-header\">\r\n        <span class=\"section-tag\">HELPFUL INFORMATION</span>\r\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\">Frequently asked questions</h2>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"ff-faq-list\">\r\n        <!-- FAQ 1 -->\r\n        <div class=\"ff-faq-item faq-item\">\r\n          <button class=\"ff-faq-btn faq-question-btn\">\r\n            <span>Does SpeeGo help negotiate MOQs?</span>\r\n            <span class=\"ff-faq-plus\">+</span>\r\n          </button>\r\n          <div class=\"ff-faq-answer\">\r\n            <p>Yes. SpeeGo directly works with manufacturing plants to negotiate flexible minimum order quantities (MOQ) tailored to your budget and growth stage.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- FAQ 2 -->\r\n        <div class=\"ff-faq-item faq-item\">\r\n          <button class=\"ff-faq-btn faq-question-btn\">\r\n            <span>How can I follow production progress?</span>\r\n            <span class=\"ff-faq-plus\">+</span>\r\n          </button>\r\n          <div class=\"ff-faq-answer\">\r\n            <p>Our on-site SpeeGo team shares real-time photo logs, inspection videos, and production milestone reports to ensure you stay fully informed at every stage.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- FAQ 3 -->\r\n        <div class=\"ff-faq-item faq-item\">\r\n          <button class=\"ff-faq-btn faq-question-btn\">\r\n            <span>What does a QC report include?</span>\r\n            <span class=\"ff-faq-plus\">+</span>\r\n          </button>\r\n          <div class=\"ff-faq-answer\">\r\n            <p>QC reports include piece-by-piece counting data, high-resolution defect and angle photography, functional testing videos, categorized defect severity logs, and a final sign-off inspection summary.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- FAQ 4 -->\r\n        <div class=\"ff-faq-item faq-item\">\r\n          <button class=\"ff-faq-btn faq-question-btn\">\r\n            <span>Can SpeeGo ship the goods after inspection?</span>\r\n            <span class=\"ff-faq-plus\">+</span>\r\n          </button>\r\n          <div class=\"ff-faq-answer\">\r\n            <p>Yes. SpeeGo provides an end-to-end supply chain solution: from factory quality inspection and cargo consolidation to international air/sea freight, customs clearance, and last-mile delivery.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- FAQ 5 -->\r\n        <div class=\"ff-faq-item faq-item\">\r\n          <button class=\"ff-faq-btn faq-question-btn\">\r\n            <span>Which manufacturing models does SpeeGo support?</span>\r\n            <span class=\"ff-faq-plus\">+</span>\r\n          </button>\r\n          <div class=\"ff-faq-answer\">\r\n            <p>SpeeGo supports all three major manufacturing models: OEM (custom build to your design), ODM (customising proven factory formulations), and Private Label (affixing your own brand to existing products).</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <!-- 9. SPEEGO CUSTOMERS (TESTIMONIALS) -->\r\n  <section class=\"ff-testimonial-section\" style=\"background: #FFFFFF;\">\r\n    <div class=\"container\">\r\n      <div class=\"ff-section-header\">\r\n        <span class=\"ff-tag-eyebrow\">SPEEGO CUSTOMERS</span>\r\n        <h2 class=\"ff-section-title\">Working alongside your business</h2>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"testimonials-2col-grid\">\r\n        <!-- Testimonial 1: Kevin Le -->\r\n        <div class=\"testimonial-card-sourcing\">\r\n          <div>\r\n            <div class=\"ff-quote-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-bottom: 16px;\">\r\n              <span></span><span></span>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <blockquote class=\"ff-quote-text\" style=\"font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\r\n              “The on-site QC team saved us thousands of dollars before the container was sealed.”\r\n            </blockquote>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"ff-author-info\">\r\n            <div class=\"ff-author-name\">Kevin Le</div>\r\n            <div class=\"ff-author-title\">CEO, Glamour Nail Supplies · California, USA</div>\r\n            <div class=\"ff-author-ref\">\r\n              <a href=\"#/en/sourcing\" class=\"ff-ref-link\">As published on the SpeeGo website ↗</a>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Testimonial 2: Sarah Mitchell -->\r\n        <div class=\"testimonial-card-sourcing\">\r\n          <div>\r\n            <div class=\"ff-quote-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-bottom: 16px;\">\r\n              <span></span><span></span>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <blockquote class=\"ff-quote-text\" style=\"font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\r\n              “The real-time OMS tracking and zero-hidden-costs policy make SpeeGo our most reliable supply chain partner.”\r\n            </blockquote>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"ff-author-info\">\r\n            <div class=\"ff-author-name\">Sarah Mitchell</div>\r\n            <div class=\"ff-author-title\">Operations Director, EcoLiving Home · Australia</div>\r\n            <div class=\"ff-author-ref\">\r\n              <a href=\"#/en/sourcing\" class=\"ff-ref-link\">As published on the SpeeGo website ↗</a>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <!-- 10. CONSULTATION FORM BAND -->\r\n  <div data-component=\"cta-form\" data-variant=\"band\" id=\"contact-form\"></div>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n','[Dịch vụ EN] Global Sourcing &amp; Quality Control','','inherit','closed','closed','','28-revision-v1','','','2026-09-26 14:15:12','2026-09-26 14:15:12','',28,'http://localhost/wordpress_demo/?p=273',0,'revision','',0),(274,0,'2026-09-26 14:15:12','2026-09-26 14:15:12','\r\n\r\n<div class=\"page-container page-shipping-routes\"\r\n     data-page=\"en-shipping-routes\"\r\n     data-nav=\"shipping-routes\"\r\n     data-breadcrumb=\'[{\"label\":\"Home\",\"href\":\"#/en/knowledge\"},{\"label\":\"Shipping Routes from China\",\"href\":\"#/en/shipping-routes\"}]\'>\r\n\r\n  <!-- 1. HERO SECTION (2 COLUMNS) -->\r\n  <section class=\"page-hero-2col\">\r\n    <div class=\"container\">\r\n      <div class=\"hero-2col-grid\">\r\n        <!-- Left Column: Title & Intro -->\r\n        <div class=\"hero-2col-left\">\r\n          <div class=\"hero-tag-bar\">INTERNATIONAL FREIGHT</div>\r\n          <h1 class=\"hero-h1-clean\" id=\"routeHeroTitle\">\r\n            <span class=\"hero-h1-line\">Freight forwarding from <span id=\"routeOriginName\">China</span></span><br>\r\n            <span class=\"text-orange\">to US, Canada &amp; Australia</span>\r\n          </h1>\r\n          <p class=\"hero-desc-clean\" id=\"routeHeroDesc\">\r\n            Supporting Full Container Load (FCL) and Less than Container Load (LCL) freight from <span id=\"routeOriginDescName\">China</span> to the US, Canada, and Australia, accommodating the dynamic needs of businesses at any scale.\r\n          </p>\r\n          <div class=\"hero-actions-row\">\r\n            <a href=\"#contact-form\" class=\"btn-orange\">\r\n              Discuss Your Needs ↗\r\n            </a>\r\n            <a href=\"tel:+84906828898\" class=\"hero-phone-label\">\r\n              (+84) 906 828 898\r\n            </a>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Right Column: SpeeGo Warehouse Facility Image -->\r\n        <div class=\"hero-2col-right\">\r\n          <div class=\"hero-img-card-wrap\">\r\n            <img src=\"assets/warehouse_hero.jpg\" alt=\"Connecting goods. Expanding markets.\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; this.src=\'assets/port_sunset_hero.jpg\';\">\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <!-- 2. ORIGIN (moved to header Logistics dropdown) -->\r\n\r\n  <!-- 3. SHIPPING CORRIDORS (4 DESTINATION CARDS) -->\r\n  <section class=\"route-dest-section\">\r\n    <div class=\"container\">\r\n      <div class=\"section-header\">\r\n        <span class=\"section-tag\">SHIPPING CORRIDORS</span>\r\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\">Your business destinations.</h2>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"dest-cards-grid\">\r\n        <!-- Card US -->\r\n        <a href=\"#contact-form\" class=\"dest-card-item\">\r\n          <div class=\"dest-card-header\">\r\n            <span>US</span>\r\n            <span class=\"dest-arrow\">↗</span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"dest-card-title\" id=\"destRouteUS\">China ➔ United States</div>\r\n        </a>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Card CA -->\r\n        <a href=\"#contact-form\" class=\"dest-card-item\">\r\n          <div class=\"dest-card-header\">\r\n            <span>CA</span>\r\n            <span class=\"dest-arrow\">↗</span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"dest-card-title\" id=\"destRouteCA\">China ➔ Canada</div>\r\n        </a>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Card AU -->\r\n        <a href=\"#contact-form\" class=\"dest-card-item\">\r\n          <div class=\"dest-card-header\">\r\n            <span>AU</span>\r\n            <span class=\"dest-arrow\">↗</span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"dest-card-title\" id=\"destRouteAU\">China ➔ Australia</div>\r\n        </a>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Card GLOBAL -->\r\n        <a href=\"#contact-form\" class=\"dest-card-item\">\r\n          <div class=\"dest-card-header\">\r\n            <span>GLOBAL</span>\r\n            <span class=\"dest-arrow\">↗</span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"dest-card-title\" id=\"destRouteGlobal\">China ➔ Other Countries</div>\r\n        </a>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <!-- 4. TRANSPORTATION MODES (3 MODES) -->\r\n  <section class=\"shipping-methods-section\">\r\n    <div class=\"container\">\r\n      <div class=\"section-header\">\r\n        <span class=\"section-tag\">TRANSPORTATION MODES</span>\r\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\">Flexible transit methods.</h2>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"methods-3col-grid\">\r\n        <!-- Mode 01 -->\r\n        <div class=\"method-col-item\"><figure class=\"method-col-visual\"><img src=\"assets/aerial-view-cargo-ship.jpg\" alt=\"Ocean freight cargo ship\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>\r\n          <div class=\"method-col-num\">01</div>\r\n          <div class=\"method-col-title\">Ocean Freight (FCL &amp; LCL)</div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Mode 02 -->\r\n        <div class=\"method-col-item\"><figure class=\"method-col-visual\"><img src=\"assets/global-logistic-airplane.jpg\" alt=\"Air freight aircraft\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>\r\n          <div class=\"method-col-num\">02</div>\r\n          <div class=\"method-col-title\">Air Freight Services</div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Mode 03 -->\r\n        <div class=\"method-col-item\"><figure class=\"method-col-visual\"><img src=\"assets/futuristic-truck.jpg\" alt=\"Overland freight truck\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>\r\n          <div class=\"method-col-num\">03</div>\r\n          <div class=\"method-col-title\">Overland Trucking</div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <!-- 5. 8-STEP WORKFLOW (DARK NAVY #04243D) -->\r\n  <section class=\"process-8steps-section\">\r\n    <div class=\"container\">\r\n      <div class=\"section-header\">\r\n        <span class=\"section-tag\" style=\"color: var(--speego-accent);\">8-STEP WORKFLOW</span>\r\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">\r\n          Clear steps.<br>\r\n          End-to-end connectivity.\r\n        </h2>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"process-8steps-grid\">\r\n        <!-- Step 01 -->\r\n        <div class=\"step-8-item\">\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-num\">01</div>\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-title\">Requirement Intake</div>\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-desc\">Record commodity details, origin, and destination requirements.</div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Step 02 -->\r\n        <div class=\"step-8-item\">\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-num\">02</div>\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-title\">Solution Advisory</div>\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-desc\">Select the optimal route balancing budget and transit timeline.</div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Step 03 -->\r\n        <div class=\"step-8-item\">\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-num\">03</div>\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-title\">Sourcing Network</div>\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-desc\">Connect with verified factories and suppliers upon request.</div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Step 04 -->\r\n        <div class=\"step-8-item\">\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-num\">04</div>\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-title\">Production Monitoring</div>\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-desc\">Track production milestones aligned with client delivery schedules.</div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Step 05 -->\r\n        <div class=\"step-8-item\">\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-num\">05</div>\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-title\">Quality Control</div>\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-desc\">On-site quality inspection before packaging and factory dispatch.</div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Step 06 -->\r\n        <div class=\"step-8-item\">\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-num\">06</div>\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-title\">Documentation &amp; Clearance</div>\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-desc\">Prepare complete dossiers and handle customs export-import procedures.</div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Step 07 -->\r\n        <div class=\"step-8-item\">\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-num\">07</div>\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-title\">Global Transportation</div>\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-desc\">Execute multi-modal transit via agreed air, ocean, or overland routes.</div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Step 08 -->\r\n        <div class=\"step-8-item\">\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-num\">08</div>\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-title\">Completion &amp; Handover</div>\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-desc\">Finalize delivery and hand over all commercial &amp; customs documentation.</div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <!-- 6. FREIGHT RATE TRANSPARENCY -->\r\n  <section class=\"route-rate-section\">\r\n    <div class=\"container\">\r\n      <div class=\"section-header\">\r\n        <span class=\"section-tag\">TRANSPARENT PRICING</span>\r\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\">Shipping Rate Inquiries</h2>\r\n        <p class=\"ff-section-sub\">Fixed public tariffs are not listed here. Contact SpeeGo to receive customized quotations per consignment.</p>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"rate-table-card\">\r\n        <!-- Row 1: Air Freight -->\r\n        <div class=\"rate-table-row\">\r\n          <div class=\"rate-col-name\">Air Freight</div>\r\n          <div class=\"rate-col-desc\">Based on chargeable weight and destination airport</div>\r\n          <a href=\"#contact-form\" class=\"rate-col-action\">Get a Quote ↗</a>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Row 2: Ocean Freight · FCL -->\r\n        <div class=\"rate-table-row\">\r\n          <div class=\"rate-col-name\">Ocean Freight · FCL</div>\r\n          <div class=\"rate-col-desc\">Based on container type (20ft/40ft/HQ), port of origin &amp; destination</div>\r\n          <a href=\"#contact-form\" class=\"rate-col-action\">Get a Quote ↗</a>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Row 3: Ocean Freight · LCL -->\r\n        <div class=\"rate-table-row\">\r\n          <div class=\"rate-col-name\">Ocean Freight · LCL</div>\r\n          <div class=\"rate-col-desc\">Based on cargo volume (CBM), commodity classification, and trade lane</div>\r\n          <a href=\"#contact-form\" class=\"rate-col-action\">Get a Quote ↗</a>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <p class=\"rate-table-footnote\">Inquire with our team for itemized quotes and specialized handling requests.</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <!-- 7. WHY CHOOSE SPEEGO (5 CARDS LIGHT GRAY BACKGROUND) -->\r\n  <section class=\"ie-why-section\">\r\n    <div class=\"container\">\r\n      <div class=\"section-header\">\r\n        <span class=\"section-tag\">WHY CHOOSE SPEEGO</span>\r\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\">Partnering on your global journey.</h2>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"ie-why-grid\">\r\n        <!-- Card 01 -->\r\n        <div class=\"ie-service-card\">\r\n          <div class=\"ie-badge-box\">01</div>\r\n          <h3 class=\"ie-card-h3\">Reliable Transit Time</h3>\r\n          <p class=\"ie-card-body\">Estimated from 7 days via air freight and 30 days via ocean freight. Exact schedules confirmed per lane and shipment.</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Card 02 -->\r\n        <div class=\"ie-service-card\">\r\n          <div class=\"ie-badge-box\">02</div>\r\n          <h3 class=\"ie-card-h3\">Cost Optimization</h3>\r\n          <p class=\"ie-card-body\">Tailored routing and transparent quotations aligned with your business volume and budget.</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Card 03 -->\r\n        <div class=\"ie-service-card\">\r\n          <div class=\"ie-badge-box\">03</div>\r\n          <h3 class=\"ie-card-h3\">Multi-modal Flexibility</h3>\r\n          <p class=\"ie-card-body\">Select the optimal freight mode matched to your product sensitivity, timeline, and delivery requirements.</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Card 04 -->\r\n        <div class=\"ie-service-card\">\r\n          <div class=\"ie-badge-box\">04</div>\r\n          <h3 class=\"ie-card-h3\">US Warehousing &amp; Fulfillment</h3>\r\n          <p class=\"ie-card-body\">Direct connection to SpeeGo\'s 10,000 ft² Houston facility for storage and order fulfillment across North America.</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Card 05 -->\r\n        <div class=\"ie-service-card\">\r\n          <div class=\"ie-badge-box\">05</div>\r\n          <h3 class=\"ie-card-h3\">US Corporate Entity</h3>\r\n          <p class=\"ie-card-body\">Incorporated business presence and operations in Texas, providing seamless cross-border coordination.</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <!-- 8. CONSULTATION FORM BAND -->\r\n  <div data-component=\"cta-form\" data-variant=\"band\" id=\"contact-form\"></div>\r\n<!-- 9. FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS (FAQ ACCORDION) -->\r\n  <section class=\"ff-faq-section\" style=\"background: #FFFFFF;\">\r\n    <div class=\"container\">\r\n      <div class=\"section-header\">\r\n        <span class=\"section-tag\">USEFUL INFORMATION</span>\r\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"ff-faq-list\">\r\n        <!-- FAQ 1 -->\r\n        <div class=\"ff-faq-item faq-item\">\r\n          <button class=\"ff-faq-btn faq-question-btn\">\r\n            <span>Which destination markets does SpeeGo support?</span>\r\n            <span class=\"ff-faq-plus\">+</span>\r\n          </button>\r\n          <div class=\"ff-faq-answer\">\r\n            <p>SpeeGo focuses primarily on the United States (US), Canada (CA), and Australia (AU), alongside an extensive global partner network connecting additional markets worldwide.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- FAQ 2 -->\r\n        <div class=\"ff-faq-item faq-item\">\r\n          <button class=\"ff-faq-btn faq-question-btn\">\r\n            <span>Can I ship Less-than-Container Load (LCL) consignments?</span>\r\n            <span class=\"ff-faq-plus\">+</span>\r\n          </button>\r\n          <div class=\"ff-faq-answer\">\r\n            <p>Yes. SpeeGo provides consolidated LCL ocean freight and air cargo solutions for small to medium batches, optimizing logistics expenses.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- FAQ 3 -->\r\n        <div class=\"ff-faq-item faq-item\">\r\n          <button class=\"ff-faq-btn faq-question-btn\">\r\n            <span>Are transit times guaranteed?</span>\r\n            <span class=\"ff-faq-plus\">+</span>\r\n          </button>\r\n          <div class=\"ff-faq-answer\">\r\n            <p>Transit durations depend on the transport mode (~7 days for air, ~30 days for ocean), weather conditions, and seasonal carrier schedules.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- FAQ 4 -->\r\n        <div class=\"ff-faq-item faq-item\">\r\n          <button class=\"ff-faq-btn faq-question-btn\">\r\n            <span>What information is required to receive a quote?</span>\r\n            <span class=\"ff-faq-plus\">+</span>\r\n          </button>\r\n          <div class=\"ff-faq-answer\">\r\n            <p>Simply share product descriptions, estimated weight/dimensions, origin city, and target destination via our contact form or hotline.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- FAQ 5 -->\r\n        <div class=\"ff-faq-item faq-item\">\r\n          <button class=\"ff-faq-btn faq-question-btn\">\r\n            <span>Can I bundle shipping with US fulfillment?</span>\r\n            <span class=\"ff-faq-plus\">+</span>\r\n          </button>\r\n          <div class=\"ff-faq-answer\">\r\n            <p>Absolutely. Once customs clearance is completed, cargo can be delivered directly to SpeeGo\'s 10,000 ft² Houston warehouse for storage and multi-channel order fulfillment.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <!-- 10. TESTIMONIAL SECTION -->\r\n  <section class=\"ff-testimonial-section\"><div class=\"container\">\r\n    <div class=\"ff-section-header\"><span class=\"ff-tag-eyebrow\">SPEEGO CLIENTS</span><h2 class=\"ff-section-title\">Growing with our partners</h2></div>\r\n    <div class=\"testimonials-2col-grid\">\r\n      <article class=\"testimonial-card-sourcing\"><div><div class=\"ff-quote-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span></span><span></span></div><blockquote class=\"ff-quote-text\">“Regular ocean departures and bilingual support make our monthly imports much easier to manage.”</blockquote></div><div class=\"ff-author-info\"><div class=\"ff-author-name\">David Nguyen</div><div class=\"ff-author-title\">Supply Chain Manager · Texas, USA</div><div class=\"ff-author-ref\"><a href=\"#/en/shipping-routes\" class=\"ff-ref-link\">Customer story on SpeeGo website ↗</a></div></div></article>\r\n      <article class=\"testimonial-card-sourcing\"><div><div class=\"ff-quote-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span></span><span></span></div><blockquote class=\"ff-quote-text\">“Real-time OMS tracking and a zero-hidden-fee policy have made SpeeGo our most reliable supply chain partner.”</blockquote></div><div class=\"ff-author-info\"><div class=\"ff-author-name\">Sarah Mitchell</div><div class=\"ff-author-title\">Operations Director, EcoLiving Home · Australia</div><div class=\"ff-author-ref\"><a href=\"#/en/shipping-routes\" class=\"ff-ref-link\">Customer story on SpeeGo website ↗</a></div></div></article>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div></section>\r\n</div>\r\n','[Dịch vụ EN] SpeeGo Shipping Routes (Global Logistics)','','inherit','closed','closed','','29-revision-v1','','','2026-09-26 14:15:12','2026-09-26 14:15:12','',29,'http://localhost/wordpress_demo/?p=274',0,'revision','',0),(275,0,'2026-09-26 14:15:12','2026-09-26 14:15:12','\r\n\r\n<div class=\"page-container page-shipping-routes\"\r\n     data-page=\"en-shipping-routes\"\r\n     data-nav=\"shipping-routes\"\r\n     data-breadcrumb=\'[{\"label\":\"Home\",\"href\":\"#/en/knowledge\"},{\"label\":\"Shipping Routes from China\",\"href\":\"#/en/shipping-routes\"}]\'>\r\n\r\n  <!-- 1. HERO SECTION (2 COLUMNS) -->\r\n  <section class=\"page-hero-2col\">\r\n    <div class=\"container\">\r\n      <div class=\"hero-2col-grid\">\r\n        <!-- Left Column: Title & Intro -->\r\n        <div class=\"hero-2col-left\">\r\n          <div class=\"hero-tag-bar\">INTERNATIONAL FREIGHT</div>\r\n          <h1 class=\"hero-h1-clean\" id=\"routeHeroTitle\">\r\n            <span class=\"hero-h1-line\">Freight forwarding from <span id=\"routeOriginName\">China</span></span><br>\r\n            <span class=\"text-orange\">to US, Canada &amp; Australia</span>\r\n          </h1>\r\n          <p class=\"hero-desc-clean\" id=\"routeHeroDesc\">\r\n            Supporting Full Container Load (FCL) and Less than Container Load (LCL) freight from <span id=\"routeOriginDescName\">China</span> to the US, Canada, and Australia, accommodating the dynamic needs of businesses at any scale.\r\n          </p>\r\n          <div class=\"hero-actions-row\">\r\n            <a href=\"#contact-form\" class=\"btn-orange\">\r\n              Discuss Your Needs ↗\r\n            </a>\r\n            <a href=\"tel:+84906828898\" class=\"hero-phone-label\">\r\n              (+84) 906 828 898\r\n            </a>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Right Column: SpeeGo Warehouse Facility Image -->\r\n        <div class=\"hero-2col-right\">\r\n          <div class=\"hero-img-card-wrap\">\r\n            <img src=\"assets/warehouse_hero.jpg\" alt=\"Connecting goods. Expanding markets.\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; this.src=\'assets/port_sunset_hero.jpg\';\">\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <!-- 2. ORIGIN (moved to header Logistics dropdown) -->\r\n\r\n  <!-- 3. SHIPPING CORRIDORS (4 DESTINATION CARDS) -->\r\n  <section class=\"route-dest-section\">\r\n    <div class=\"container\">\r\n      <div class=\"section-header\">\r\n        <span class=\"section-tag\">SHIPPING CORRIDORS</span>\r\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\">Your business destinations.</h2>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"dest-cards-grid\">\r\n        <!-- Card US -->\r\n        <a href=\"#contact-form\" class=\"dest-card-item\">\r\n          <div class=\"dest-card-header\">\r\n            <span>US</span>\r\n            <span class=\"dest-arrow\">↗</span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"dest-card-title\" id=\"destRouteUS\">China ➔ United States</div>\r\n        </a>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Card CA -->\r\n        <a href=\"#contact-form\" class=\"dest-card-item\">\r\n          <div class=\"dest-card-header\">\r\n            <span>CA</span>\r\n            <span class=\"dest-arrow\">↗</span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"dest-card-title\" id=\"destRouteCA\">China ➔ Canada</div>\r\n        </a>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Card AU -->\r\n        <a href=\"#contact-form\" class=\"dest-card-item\">\r\n          <div class=\"dest-card-header\">\r\n            <span>AU</span>\r\n            <span class=\"dest-arrow\">↗</span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"dest-card-title\" id=\"destRouteAU\">China ➔ Australia</div>\r\n        </a>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Card GLOBAL -->\r\n        <a href=\"#contact-form\" class=\"dest-card-item\">\r\n          <div class=\"dest-card-header\">\r\n            <span>GLOBAL</span>\r\n            <span class=\"dest-arrow\">↗</span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"dest-card-title\" id=\"destRouteGlobal\">China ➔ Other Countries</div>\r\n        </a>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <!-- 4. TRANSPORTATION MODES (3 MODES) -->\r\n  <section class=\"shipping-methods-section\">\r\n    <div class=\"container\">\r\n      <div class=\"section-header\">\r\n        <span class=\"section-tag\">TRANSPORTATION MODES</span>\r\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\">Flexible transit methods.</h2>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"methods-3col-grid\">\r\n        <!-- Mode 01 -->\r\n        <div class=\"method-col-item\"><figure class=\"method-col-visual\"><img src=\"assets/aerial-view-cargo-ship.jpg\" alt=\"Ocean freight cargo ship\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>\r\n          <div class=\"method-col-num\">01</div>\r\n          <div class=\"method-col-title\">Ocean Freight (FCL &amp; LCL)</div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Mode 02 -->\r\n        <div class=\"method-col-item\"><figure class=\"method-col-visual\"><img src=\"assets/global-logistic-airplane.jpg\" alt=\"Air freight aircraft\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>\r\n          <div class=\"method-col-num\">02</div>\r\n          <div class=\"method-col-title\">Air Freight Services</div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Mode 03 -->\r\n        <div class=\"method-col-item\"><figure class=\"method-col-visual\"><img src=\"assets/futuristic-truck.jpg\" alt=\"Overland freight truck\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>\r\n          <div class=\"method-col-num\">03</div>\r\n          <div class=\"method-col-title\">Overland Trucking</div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <!-- 5. 8-STEP WORKFLOW (DARK NAVY #04243D) -->\r\n  <section class=\"process-8steps-section\">\r\n    <div class=\"container\">\r\n      <div class=\"section-header\">\r\n        <span class=\"section-tag\" style=\"color: var(--speego-accent);\">8-STEP WORKFLOW</span>\r\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">\r\n          Clear steps.<br>\r\n          End-to-end connectivity.\r\n        </h2>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"process-8steps-grid\">\r\n        <!-- Step 01 -->\r\n        <div class=\"step-8-item\">\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-num\">01</div>\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-title\">Requirement Intake</div>\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-desc\">Record commodity details, origin, and destination requirements.</div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Step 02 -->\r\n        <div class=\"step-8-item\">\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-num\">02</div>\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-title\">Solution Advisory</div>\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-desc\">Select the optimal route balancing budget and transit timeline.</div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Step 03 -->\r\n        <div class=\"step-8-item\">\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-num\">03</div>\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-title\">Sourcing Network</div>\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-desc\">Connect with verified factories and suppliers upon request.</div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Step 04 -->\r\n        <div class=\"step-8-item\">\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-num\">04</div>\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-title\">Production Monitoring</div>\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-desc\">Track production milestones aligned with client delivery schedules.</div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Step 05 -->\r\n        <div class=\"step-8-item\">\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-num\">05</div>\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-title\">Quality Control</div>\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-desc\">On-site quality inspection before packaging and factory dispatch.</div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Step 06 -->\r\n        <div class=\"step-8-item\">\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-num\">06</div>\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-title\">Documentation &amp; Clearance</div>\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-desc\">Prepare complete dossiers and handle customs export-import procedures.</div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Step 07 -->\r\n        <div class=\"step-8-item\">\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-num\">07</div>\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-title\">Global Transportation</div>\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-desc\">Execute multi-modal transit via agreed air, ocean, or overland routes.</div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Step 08 -->\r\n        <div class=\"step-8-item\">\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-num\">08</div>\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-title\">Completion &amp; Handover</div>\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-desc\">Finalize delivery and hand over all commercial &amp; customs documentation.</div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <!-- 6. FREIGHT RATE TRANSPARENCY -->\r\n  <section class=\"route-rate-section\">\r\n    <div class=\"container\">\r\n      <div class=\"section-header\">\r\n        <span class=\"section-tag\">TRANSPARENT PRICING</span>\r\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\">Shipping Rate Inquiries</h2>\r\n        <p class=\"ff-section-sub\">Fixed public tariffs are not listed here. Contact SpeeGo to receive customized quotations per consignment.</p>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"rate-table-card\">\r\n        <!-- Row 1: Air Freight -->\r\n        <div class=\"rate-table-row\">\r\n          <div class=\"rate-col-name\">Air Freight</div>\r\n          <div class=\"rate-col-desc\">Based on chargeable weight and destination airport</div>\r\n          <a href=\"#contact-form\" class=\"rate-col-action\">Get a Quote ↗</a>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Row 2: Ocean Freight · FCL -->\r\n        <div class=\"rate-table-row\">\r\n          <div class=\"rate-col-name\">Ocean Freight · FCL</div>\r\n          <div class=\"rate-col-desc\">Based on container type (20ft/40ft/HQ), port of origin &amp; destination</div>\r\n          <a href=\"#contact-form\" class=\"rate-col-action\">Get a Quote ↗</a>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Row 3: Ocean Freight · LCL -->\r\n        <div class=\"rate-table-row\">\r\n          <div class=\"rate-col-name\">Ocean Freight · LCL</div>\r\n          <div class=\"rate-col-desc\">Based on cargo volume (CBM), commodity classification, and trade lane</div>\r\n          <a href=\"#contact-form\" class=\"rate-col-action\">Get a Quote ↗</a>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <p class=\"rate-table-footnote\">Inquire with our team for itemized quotes and specialized handling requests.</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <!-- 7. WHY CHOOSE SPEEGO (5 CARDS LIGHT GRAY BACKGROUND) -->\r\n  <section class=\"ie-why-section\">\r\n    <div class=\"container\">\r\n      <div class=\"section-header\">\r\n        <span class=\"section-tag\">WHY CHOOSE SPEEGO</span>\r\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\">Partnering on your global journey.</h2>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"ie-why-grid\">\r\n        <!-- Card 01 -->\r\n        <div class=\"ie-service-card\">\r\n          <div class=\"ie-badge-box\">01</div>\r\n          <h3 class=\"ie-card-h3\">Reliable Transit Time</h3>\r\n          <p class=\"ie-card-body\">Estimated from 7 days via air freight and 30 days via ocean freight. Exact schedules confirmed per lane and shipment.</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Card 02 -->\r\n        <div class=\"ie-service-card\">\r\n          <div class=\"ie-badge-box\">02</div>\r\n          <h3 class=\"ie-card-h3\">Cost Optimization</h3>\r\n          <p class=\"ie-card-body\">Tailored routing and transparent quotations aligned with your business volume and budget.</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Card 03 -->\r\n        <div class=\"ie-service-card\">\r\n          <div class=\"ie-badge-box\">03</div>\r\n          <h3 class=\"ie-card-h3\">Multi-modal Flexibility</h3>\r\n          <p class=\"ie-card-body\">Select the optimal freight mode matched to your product sensitivity, timeline, and delivery requirements.</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Card 04 -->\r\n        <div class=\"ie-service-card\">\r\n          <div class=\"ie-badge-box\">04</div>\r\n          <h3 class=\"ie-card-h3\">US Warehousing &amp; Fulfillment</h3>\r\n          <p class=\"ie-card-body\">Direct connection to SpeeGo\'s 10,000 ft² Houston facility for storage and order fulfillment across North America.</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Card 05 -->\r\n        <div class=\"ie-service-card\">\r\n          <div class=\"ie-badge-box\">05</div>\r\n          <h3 class=\"ie-card-h3\">US Corporate Entity</h3>\r\n          <p class=\"ie-card-body\">Incorporated business presence and operations in Texas, providing seamless cross-border coordination.</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <!-- 8. CONSULTATION FORM BAND -->\r\n  <div data-component=\"cta-form\" data-variant=\"band\" id=\"contact-form\"></div>\r\n<!-- 9. FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS (FAQ ACCORDION) -->\r\n  <section class=\"ff-faq-section\" style=\"background: #FFFFFF;\">\r\n    <div class=\"container\">\r\n      <div class=\"section-header\">\r\n        <span class=\"section-tag\">USEFUL INFORMATION</span>\r\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"ff-faq-list\">\r\n        <!-- FAQ 1 -->\r\n        <div class=\"ff-faq-item faq-item\">\r\n          <button class=\"ff-faq-btn faq-question-btn\">\r\n            <span>Which destination markets does SpeeGo support?</span>\r\n            <span class=\"ff-faq-plus\">+</span>\r\n          </button>\r\n          <div class=\"ff-faq-answer\">\r\n            <p>SpeeGo focuses primarily on the United States (US), Canada (CA), and Australia (AU), alongside an extensive global partner network connecting additional markets worldwide.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- FAQ 2 -->\r\n        <div class=\"ff-faq-item faq-item\">\r\n          <button class=\"ff-faq-btn faq-question-btn\">\r\n            <span>Can I ship Less-than-Container Load (LCL) consignments?</span>\r\n            <span class=\"ff-faq-plus\">+</span>\r\n          </button>\r\n          <div class=\"ff-faq-answer\">\r\n            <p>Yes. SpeeGo provides consolidated LCL ocean freight and air cargo solutions for small to medium batches, optimizing logistics expenses.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- FAQ 3 -->\r\n        <div class=\"ff-faq-item faq-item\">\r\n          <button class=\"ff-faq-btn faq-question-btn\">\r\n            <span>Are transit times guaranteed?</span>\r\n            <span class=\"ff-faq-plus\">+</span>\r\n          </button>\r\n          <div class=\"ff-faq-answer\">\r\n            <p>Transit durations depend on the transport mode (~7 days for air, ~30 days for ocean), weather conditions, and seasonal carrier schedules.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- FAQ 4 -->\r\n        <div class=\"ff-faq-item faq-item\">\r\n          <button class=\"ff-faq-btn faq-question-btn\">\r\n            <span>What information is required to receive a quote?</span>\r\n            <span class=\"ff-faq-plus\">+</span>\r\n          </button>\r\n          <div class=\"ff-faq-answer\">\r\n            <p>Simply share product descriptions, estimated weight/dimensions, origin city, and target destination via our contact form or hotline.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- FAQ 5 -->\r\n        <div class=\"ff-faq-item faq-item\">\r\n          <button class=\"ff-faq-btn faq-question-btn\">\r\n            <span>Can I bundle shipping with US fulfillment?</span>\r\n            <span class=\"ff-faq-plus\">+</span>\r\n          </button>\r\n          <div class=\"ff-faq-answer\">\r\n            <p>Absolutely. Once customs clearance is completed, cargo can be delivered directly to SpeeGo\'s 10,000 ft² Houston warehouse for storage and multi-channel order fulfillment.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <!-- 10. TESTIMONIAL SECTION -->\r\n  <section class=\"ff-testimonial-section\"><div class=\"container\">\r\n    <div class=\"ff-section-header\"><span class=\"ff-tag-eyebrow\">SPEEGO CLIENTS</span><h2 class=\"ff-section-title\">Growing with our partners</h2></div>\r\n    <div class=\"testimonials-2col-grid\">\r\n      <article class=\"testimonial-card-sourcing\"><div><div class=\"ff-quote-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span></span><span></span></div><blockquote class=\"ff-quote-text\">“Regular ocean departures and bilingual support make our monthly imports much easier to manage.”</blockquote></div><div class=\"ff-author-info\"><div class=\"ff-author-name\">David Nguyen</div><div class=\"ff-author-title\">Supply Chain Manager · Texas, USA</div><div class=\"ff-author-ref\"><a href=\"#/en/shipping-routes\" class=\"ff-ref-link\">Customer story on SpeeGo website ↗</a></div></div></article>\r\n      <article class=\"testimonial-card-sourcing\"><div><div class=\"ff-quote-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span></span><span></span></div><blockquote class=\"ff-quote-text\">“Real-time OMS tracking and a zero-hidden-fee policy have made SpeeGo our most reliable supply chain partner.”</blockquote></div><div class=\"ff-author-info\"><div class=\"ff-author-name\">Sarah Mitchell</div><div class=\"ff-author-title\">Operations Director, EcoLiving Home · Australia</div><div class=\"ff-author-ref\"><a href=\"#/en/shipping-routes\" class=\"ff-ref-link\">Customer story on SpeeGo website ↗</a></div></div></article>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div></section>\r\n</div>\r\n','[Dịch vụ EN] Freight from China to the US, Canada &amp; Australia','','inherit','closed','closed','','32-revision-v1','','','2026-09-26 14:15:12','2026-09-26 14:15:12','',32,'http://localhost/wordpress_demo/?p=275',0,'revision','',0),(276,0,'2026-09-26 14:15:12','2026-09-26 14:15:12','\r\n\r\n<div class=\"page-container page-shipping-routes\"\r\n     data-page=\"en-shipping-routes\"\r\n     data-nav=\"shipping-routes\"\r\n     data-breadcrumb=\'[{\"label\":\"Home\",\"href\":\"#/en/knowledge\"},{\"label\":\"Shipping Routes from China\",\"href\":\"#/en/shipping-routes\"}]\'>\r\n\r\n  <!-- 1. HERO SECTION (2 COLUMNS) -->\r\n  <section class=\"page-hero-2col\">\r\n    <div class=\"container\">\r\n      <div class=\"hero-2col-grid\">\r\n        <!-- Left Column: Title & Intro -->\r\n        <div class=\"hero-2col-left\">\r\n          <div class=\"hero-tag-bar\">INTERNATIONAL FREIGHT</div>\r\n          <h1 class=\"hero-h1-clean\" id=\"routeHeroTitle\">\r\n            <span class=\"hero-h1-line\">Freight forwarding from <span id=\"routeOriginName\">China</span></span><br>\r\n            <span class=\"text-orange\">to US, Canada &amp; Australia</span>\r\n          </h1>\r\n          <p class=\"hero-desc-clean\" id=\"routeHeroDesc\">\r\n            Supporting Full Container Load (FCL) and Less than Container Load (LCL) freight from <span id=\"routeOriginDescName\">China</span> to the US, Canada, and Australia, accommodating the dynamic needs of businesses at any scale.\r\n          </p>\r\n          <div class=\"hero-actions-row\">\r\n            <a href=\"#contact-form\" class=\"btn-orange\">\r\n              Discuss Your Needs ↗\r\n            </a>\r\n            <a href=\"tel:+84906828898\" class=\"hero-phone-label\">\r\n              (+84) 906 828 898\r\n            </a>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Right Column: SpeeGo Warehouse Facility Image -->\r\n        <div class=\"hero-2col-right\">\r\n          <div class=\"hero-img-card-wrap\">\r\n            <img src=\"assets/warehouse_hero.jpg\" alt=\"Connecting goods. Expanding markets.\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; this.src=\'assets/port_sunset_hero.jpg\';\">\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <!-- 2. ORIGIN (moved to header Logistics dropdown) -->\r\n\r\n  <!-- 3. SHIPPING CORRIDORS (4 DESTINATION CARDS) -->\r\n  <section class=\"route-dest-section\">\r\n    <div class=\"container\">\r\n      <div class=\"section-header\">\r\n        <span class=\"section-tag\">SHIPPING CORRIDORS</span>\r\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\">Your business destinations.</h2>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"dest-cards-grid\">\r\n        <!-- Card US -->\r\n        <a href=\"#contact-form\" class=\"dest-card-item\">\r\n          <div class=\"dest-card-header\">\r\n            <span>US</span>\r\n            <span class=\"dest-arrow\">↗</span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"dest-card-title\" id=\"destRouteUS\">China ➔ United States</div>\r\n        </a>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Card CA -->\r\n        <a href=\"#contact-form\" class=\"dest-card-item\">\r\n          <div class=\"dest-card-header\">\r\n            <span>CA</span>\r\n            <span class=\"dest-arrow\">↗</span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"dest-card-title\" id=\"destRouteCA\">China ➔ Canada</div>\r\n        </a>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Card AU -->\r\n        <a href=\"#contact-form\" class=\"dest-card-item\">\r\n          <div class=\"dest-card-header\">\r\n            <span>AU</span>\r\n            <span class=\"dest-arrow\">↗</span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"dest-card-title\" id=\"destRouteAU\">China ➔ Australia</div>\r\n        </a>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Card GLOBAL -->\r\n        <a href=\"#contact-form\" class=\"dest-card-item\">\r\n          <div class=\"dest-card-header\">\r\n            <span>GLOBAL</span>\r\n            <span class=\"dest-arrow\">↗</span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"dest-card-title\" id=\"destRouteGlobal\">China ➔ Other Countries</div>\r\n        </a>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <!-- 4. TRANSPORTATION MODES (3 MODES) -->\r\n  <section class=\"shipping-methods-section\">\r\n    <div class=\"container\">\r\n      <div class=\"section-header\">\r\n        <span class=\"section-tag\">TRANSPORTATION MODES</span>\r\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\">Flexible transit methods.</h2>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"methods-3col-grid\">\r\n        <!-- Mode 01 -->\r\n        <div class=\"method-col-item\"><figure class=\"method-col-visual\"><img src=\"assets/aerial-view-cargo-ship.jpg\" alt=\"Ocean freight cargo ship\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>\r\n          <div class=\"method-col-num\">01</div>\r\n          <div class=\"method-col-title\">Ocean Freight (FCL &amp; LCL)</div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Mode 02 -->\r\n        <div class=\"method-col-item\"><figure class=\"method-col-visual\"><img src=\"assets/global-logistic-airplane.jpg\" alt=\"Air freight aircraft\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>\r\n          <div class=\"method-col-num\">02</div>\r\n          <div class=\"method-col-title\">Air Freight Services</div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Mode 03 -->\r\n        <div class=\"method-col-item\"><figure class=\"method-col-visual\"><img src=\"assets/futuristic-truck.jpg\" alt=\"Overland freight truck\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>\r\n          <div class=\"method-col-num\">03</div>\r\n          <div class=\"method-col-title\">Overland Trucking</div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <!-- 5. 8-STEP WORKFLOW (DARK NAVY #04243D) -->\r\n  <section class=\"process-8steps-section\">\r\n    <div class=\"container\">\r\n      <div class=\"section-header\">\r\n        <span class=\"section-tag\" style=\"color: var(--speego-accent);\">8-STEP WORKFLOW</span>\r\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">\r\n          Clear steps.<br>\r\n          End-to-end connectivity.\r\n        </h2>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"process-8steps-grid\">\r\n        <!-- Step 01 -->\r\n        <div class=\"step-8-item\">\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-num\">01</div>\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-title\">Requirement Intake</div>\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-desc\">Record commodity details, origin, and destination requirements.</div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Step 02 -->\r\n        <div class=\"step-8-item\">\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-num\">02</div>\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-title\">Solution Advisory</div>\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-desc\">Select the optimal route balancing budget and transit timeline.</div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Step 03 -->\r\n        <div class=\"step-8-item\">\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-num\">03</div>\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-title\">Sourcing Network</div>\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-desc\">Connect with verified factories and suppliers upon request.</div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Step 04 -->\r\n        <div class=\"step-8-item\">\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-num\">04</div>\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-title\">Production Monitoring</div>\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-desc\">Track production milestones aligned with client delivery schedules.</div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Step 05 -->\r\n        <div class=\"step-8-item\">\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-num\">05</div>\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-title\">Quality Control</div>\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-desc\">On-site quality inspection before packaging and factory dispatch.</div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Step 06 -->\r\n        <div class=\"step-8-item\">\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-num\">06</div>\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-title\">Documentation &amp; Clearance</div>\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-desc\">Prepare complete dossiers and handle customs export-import procedures.</div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Step 07 -->\r\n        <div class=\"step-8-item\">\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-num\">07</div>\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-title\">Global Transportation</div>\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-desc\">Execute multi-modal transit via agreed air, ocean, or overland routes.</div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Step 08 -->\r\n        <div class=\"step-8-item\">\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-num\">08</div>\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-title\">Completion &amp; Handover</div>\r\n          <div class=\"step-8-desc\">Finalize delivery and hand over all commercial &amp; customs documentation.</div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <!-- 6. FREIGHT RATE TRANSPARENCY -->\r\n  <section class=\"route-rate-section\">\r\n    <div class=\"container\">\r\n      <div class=\"section-header\">\r\n        <span class=\"section-tag\">TRANSPARENT PRICING</span>\r\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\">Shipping Rate Inquiries</h2>\r\n        <p class=\"ff-section-sub\">Fixed public tariffs are not listed here. Contact SpeeGo to receive customized quotations per consignment.</p>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"rate-table-card\">\r\n        <!-- Row 1: Air Freight -->\r\n        <div class=\"rate-table-row\">\r\n          <div class=\"rate-col-name\">Air Freight</div>\r\n          <div class=\"rate-col-desc\">Based on chargeable weight and destination airport</div>\r\n          <a href=\"#contact-form\" class=\"rate-col-action\">Get a Quote ↗</a>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Row 2: Ocean Freight · FCL -->\r\n        <div class=\"rate-table-row\">\r\n          <div class=\"rate-col-name\">Ocean Freight · FCL</div>\r\n          <div class=\"rate-col-desc\">Based on container type (20ft/40ft/HQ), port of origin &amp; destination</div>\r\n          <a href=\"#contact-form\" class=\"rate-col-action\">Get a Quote ↗</a>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Row 3: Ocean Freight · LCL -->\r\n        <div class=\"rate-table-row\">\r\n          <div class=\"rate-col-name\">Ocean Freight · LCL</div>\r\n          <div class=\"rate-col-desc\">Based on cargo volume (CBM), commodity classification, and trade lane</div>\r\n          <a href=\"#contact-form\" class=\"rate-col-action\">Get a Quote ↗</a>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <p class=\"rate-table-footnote\">Inquire with our team for itemized quotes and specialized handling requests.</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <!-- 7. WHY CHOOSE SPEEGO (5 CARDS LIGHT GRAY BACKGROUND) -->\r\n  <section class=\"ie-why-section\">\r\n    <div class=\"container\">\r\n      <div class=\"section-header\">\r\n        <span class=\"section-tag\">WHY CHOOSE SPEEGO</span>\r\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\">Partnering on your global journey.</h2>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"ie-why-grid\">\r\n        <!-- Card 01 -->\r\n        <div class=\"ie-service-card\">\r\n          <div class=\"ie-badge-box\">01</div>\r\n          <h3 class=\"ie-card-h3\">Reliable Transit Time</h3>\r\n          <p class=\"ie-card-body\">Estimated from 7 days via air freight and 30 days via ocean freight. Exact schedules confirmed per lane and shipment.</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Card 02 -->\r\n        <div class=\"ie-service-card\">\r\n          <div class=\"ie-badge-box\">02</div>\r\n          <h3 class=\"ie-card-h3\">Cost Optimization</h3>\r\n          <p class=\"ie-card-body\">Tailored routing and transparent quotations aligned with your business volume and budget.</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Card 03 -->\r\n        <div class=\"ie-service-card\">\r\n          <div class=\"ie-badge-box\">03</div>\r\n          <h3 class=\"ie-card-h3\">Multi-modal Flexibility</h3>\r\n          <p class=\"ie-card-body\">Select the optimal freight mode matched to your product sensitivity, timeline, and delivery requirements.</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Card 04 -->\r\n        <div class=\"ie-service-card\">\r\n          <div class=\"ie-badge-box\">04</div>\r\n          <h3 class=\"ie-card-h3\">US Warehousing &amp; Fulfillment</h3>\r\n          <p class=\"ie-card-body\">Direct connection to SpeeGo\'s 10,000 ft² Houston facility for storage and order fulfillment across North America.</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Card 05 -->\r\n        <div class=\"ie-service-card\">\r\n          <div class=\"ie-badge-box\">05</div>\r\n          <h3 class=\"ie-card-h3\">US Corporate Entity</h3>\r\n          <p class=\"ie-card-body\">Incorporated business presence and operations in Texas, providing seamless cross-border coordination.</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <!-- 8. CONSULTATION FORM BAND -->\r\n  <div data-component=\"cta-form\" data-variant=\"band\" id=\"contact-form\"></div>\r\n<!-- 9. FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS (FAQ ACCORDION) -->\r\n  <section class=\"ff-faq-section\" style=\"background: #FFFFFF;\">\r\n    <div class=\"container\">\r\n      <div class=\"section-header\">\r\n        <span class=\"section-tag\">USEFUL INFORMATION</span>\r\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"ff-faq-list\">\r\n        <!-- FAQ 1 -->\r\n        <div class=\"ff-faq-item faq-item\">\r\n          <button class=\"ff-faq-btn faq-question-btn\">\r\n            <span>Which destination markets does SpeeGo support?</span>\r\n            <span class=\"ff-faq-plus\">+</span>\r\n          </button>\r\n          <div class=\"ff-faq-answer\">\r\n            <p>SpeeGo focuses primarily on the United States (US), Canada (CA), and Australia (AU), alongside an extensive global partner network connecting additional markets worldwide.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- FAQ 2 -->\r\n        <div class=\"ff-faq-item faq-item\">\r\n          <button class=\"ff-faq-btn faq-question-btn\">\r\n            <span>Can I ship Less-than-Container Load (LCL) consignments?</span>\r\n            <span class=\"ff-faq-plus\">+</span>\r\n          </button>\r\n          <div class=\"ff-faq-answer\">\r\n            <p>Yes. SpeeGo provides consolidated LCL ocean freight and air cargo solutions for small to medium batches, optimizing logistics expenses.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- FAQ 3 -->\r\n        <div class=\"ff-faq-item faq-item\">\r\n          <button class=\"ff-faq-btn faq-question-btn\">\r\n            <span>Are transit times guaranteed?</span>\r\n            <span class=\"ff-faq-plus\">+</span>\r\n          </button>\r\n          <div class=\"ff-faq-answer\">\r\n            <p>Transit durations depend on the transport mode (~7 days for air, ~30 days for ocean), weather conditions, and seasonal carrier schedules.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- FAQ 4 -->\r\n        <div class=\"ff-faq-item faq-item\">\r\n          <button class=\"ff-faq-btn faq-question-btn\">\r\n            <span>What information is required to receive a quote?</span>\r\n            <span class=\"ff-faq-plus\">+</span>\r\n          </button>\r\n          <div class=\"ff-faq-answer\">\r\n            <p>Simply share product descriptions, estimated weight/dimensions, origin city, and target destination via our contact form or hotline.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- FAQ 5 -->\r\n        <div class=\"ff-faq-item faq-item\">\r\n          <button class=\"ff-faq-btn faq-question-btn\">\r\n            <span>Can I bundle shipping with US fulfillment?</span>\r\n            <span class=\"ff-faq-plus\">+</span>\r\n          </button>\r\n          <div class=\"ff-faq-answer\">\r\n            <p>Absolutely. Once customs clearance is completed, cargo can be delivered directly to SpeeGo\'s 10,000 ft² Houston warehouse for storage and multi-channel order fulfillment.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <!-- 10. TESTIMONIAL SECTION -->\r\n  <section class=\"ff-testimonial-section\"><div class=\"container\">\r\n    <div class=\"ff-section-header\"><span class=\"ff-tag-eyebrow\">SPEEGO CLIENTS</span><h2 class=\"ff-section-title\">Growing with our partners</h2></div>\r\n    <div class=\"testimonials-2col-grid\">\r\n      <article class=\"testimonial-card-sourcing\"><div><div class=\"ff-quote-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span></span><span></span></div><blockquote class=\"ff-quote-text\">“Regular ocean departures and bilingual support make our monthly imports much easier to manage.”</blockquote></div><div class=\"ff-author-info\"><div class=\"ff-author-name\">David Nguyen</div><div class=\"ff-author-title\">Supply Chain Manager · Texas, USA</div><div class=\"ff-author-ref\"><a href=\"#/en/shipping-routes\" class=\"ff-ref-link\">Customer story on SpeeGo website ↗</a></div></div></article>\r\n      <article class=\"testimonial-card-sourcing\"><div><div class=\"ff-quote-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span></span><span></span></div><blockquote class=\"ff-quote-text\">“Real-time OMS tracking and a zero-hidden-fee policy have made SpeeGo our most reliable supply chain partner.”</blockquote></div><div class=\"ff-author-info\"><div class=\"ff-author-name\">Sarah Mitchell</div><div class=\"ff-author-title\">Operations Director, EcoLiving Home · Australia</div><div class=\"ff-author-ref\"><a href=\"#/en/shipping-routes\" class=\"ff-ref-link\">Customer story on SpeeGo website ↗</a></div></div></article>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div></section>\r\n</div>\r\n','[Dịch vụ EN] Freight from Vietnam to the US, Canada &amp; Australia','','inherit','closed','closed','','33-revision-v1','','','2026-09-26 14:15:12','2026-09-26 14:15:12','',33,'http://localhost/wordpress_demo/?p=276',0,'revision','',0),(277,0,'2026-09-26 14:15:12','2026-09-26 14:15:12','\r\n\r\n<div class=\"page-container page-fulfillment\" \r\n     data-page=\"fulfillment\" \r\n     data-nav=\"fulfillment\" \r\n     data-breadcrumb=\'[{\"label\":\"Home\",\"href\":\"#/en/knowledge\"},{\"label\":\"Fulfillment\",\"href\":\"#/en/fulfillment\"}]\'>\r\n\r\n  <!-- 1. HERO SECTION: DARK LOGISTICS HUB OVERLAY (ANHDAU.JPG) -->\r\n  <section class=\"ff-hero-dark-section\">\r\n    <div class=\"container\">\r\n      <!-- Centered Header -->\r\n      <div class=\"ff-hero-dark-header\">\r\n        <h1 class=\"ff-hero-brand-title\">\r\n          <span class=\"ff-brand-orange\">SpeeGo</span> <span class=\"ff-brand-white\">Fulfillment</span>\r\n        </h1>\r\n        <h2 class=\"ff-hero-tagline\">Optimized warehouse operations for your business</h2>\r\n        <p class=\"ff-hero-summary\">\r\n          SpeeGo Fulfillment operates a 10,000 ft² warehouse in Houston, Texas, providing receiving, warehousing, pick &amp; pack, and order shipping across the United States.\r\n        </p>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <!-- 4 Stats Bar Columns with Vertical Orange Bars -->\r\n      <div class=\"ff-stats-bars-row\">\r\n        <div class=\"ff-stat-bar-item\">\r\n          <div class=\"ff-stat-bar-title\">10,000 ft² Floor Area</div>\r\n          <div class=\"ff-stat-bar-desc\">Operations hub in Houston, Texas.</div>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div class=\"ff-stat-bar-item\">\r\n          <div class=\"ff-stat-bar-title\">Free Inbound Handling</div>\r\n          <div class=\"ff-stat-bar-desc\">For the first 5 packages under 21kg per inbound.</div>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div class=\"ff-stat-bar-item\">\r\n          <div class=\"ff-stat-bar-title\">Free Storage (60 days)</div>\r\n          <div class=\"ff-stat-bar-desc\">Counted from the day goods arrive.</div>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div class=\"ff-stat-bar-item\">\r\n          <div class=\"ff-stat-bar-title\">$7/order Flat Fee</div>\r\n          <div class=\"ff-stat-bar-desc\">Per-order flat rate including shipping.</div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <!-- Floating Dark Glassmorphic Hub Bar -->\r\n      <div class=\"ff-dark-hub-card\">\r\n        <div class=\"ff-dark-hub-left\">\r\n          <div class=\"ff-dark-hub-tag\">OPERATIONS HUB</div>\r\n          <div class=\"ff-dark-hub-title\">SpeeGo Warehouse · Houston, Texas</div>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div class=\"ff-dark-hub-right\">\r\n          <div class=\"ff-dark-hub-address\">7303 Breen Dr, Suite D2, Houston, TX 77086</div>\r\n          <div class=\"ff-dark-hub-hotline\">\r\n            <span class=\"ff-hotline-lbl\">Hotline:</span>\r\n            <a href=\"tel:18005501496\" class=\"ff-hotline-val\">1-800-550-1496</a>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <!-- Ribbon Ticker: Vibrant SpeeGo Orange -->\r\n  <div class=\"ff-ticker-orange-wrap\">\r\n    <div class=\"ff-ticker-orange-inner\">\r\n      <span>SHIPPING &amp; DISPATCHING</span><span class=\"ff-ticker-symbol\">✦</span>\r\n      <span>STOCK TRANSFERS</span><span class=\"ff-ticker-symbol\">✦</span>\r\n      <span>GOODS-IN &amp; RECEIVING</span><span class=\"ff-ticker-symbol\">✦</span>\r\n      <span>WAREHOUSING &amp; STORAGE</span><span class=\"ff-ticker-symbol\">✦</span>\r\n      <span>PICK &amp; PACK</span><span class=\"ff-ticker-symbol\">✦</span>\r\n      <span>SHIPPING &amp; DISPATCHING</span><span class=\"ff-ticker-symbol\">✦</span>\r\n      <span>STOCK TRANSFERS</span><span class=\"ff-ticker-symbol\">✦</span>\r\n      <span>GOODS-IN &amp; RECEIVING</span><span class=\"ff-ticker-symbol\">✦</span>\r\n      <span>WAREHOUSING &amp; STORAGE</span><span class=\"ff-ticker-symbol\">✦</span>\r\n      <span>PICK &amp; PACK</span><span class=\"ff-ticker-symbol\">✦</span>\r\n      <span>SHIPPING &amp; DISPATCHING</span><span class=\"ff-ticker-symbol\">✦</span>\r\n      <span>STOCK TRANSFERS</span><span class=\"ff-ticker-symbol\">✦</span>\r\n      <span>GOODS-IN &amp; RECEIVING</span><span class=\"ff-ticker-symbol\">✦</span>\r\n      <span>WAREHOUSING &amp; STORAGE</span><span class=\"ff-ticker-symbol\">✦</span>\r\n      <span>PICK &amp; PACK</span><span class=\"ff-ticker-symbol\">✦</span>\r\n      <span>SHIPPING &amp; DISPATCHING</span><span class=\"ff-ticker-symbol\">✦</span>\r\n      <span>STOCK TRANSFERS</span><span class=\"ff-ticker-symbol\">✦</span>\r\n      <span>GOODS-IN &amp; RECEIVING</span><span class=\"ff-ticker-symbol\">✦</span>\r\n      <span>WAREHOUSING &amp; STORAGE</span><span class=\"ff-ticker-symbol\">✦</span>\r\n      <span>PICK &amp; PACK</span><span class=\"ff-ticker-symbol\">✦</span>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n  <!-- 5 Quick-link Cards -->\r\n  <section class=\"ff-quicklinks-section\">\r\n    <div class=\"container\">\r\n      <div class=\"ff-quicklinks-grid\">\r\n        <a href=\"#bang-gia-fulfillment\" class=\"ff-quicklink-card\">\r\n          <div class=\"ff-quicklink-title\">Fulfillment pricing</div>\r\n          <div class=\"ff-quicklink-sub\">Warehouse service fees in the US</div>\r\n          <div class=\"ff-quicklink-btn\">View ➔</div>\r\n        </a>\r\n        <a href=\"#shipping-rates\" class=\"ff-quicklink-card\">\r\n          <div class=\"ff-quicklink-title\">USPS Ground Advantage by zone</div>\r\n          <div class=\"ff-quicklink-sub\">Reference rates for zones 1-9</div>\r\n          <div class=\"ff-quicklink-btn\">View ➔</div>\r\n        </a>\r\n        <a href=\"#uoc-tinh-chi-phi\" class=\"ff-quicklink-card\">\r\n          <div class=\"ff-quicklink-title\">Fulfillment cost estimate</div>\r\n          <div class=\"ff-quicklink-sub\">Pick &amp; pack + packaging + USPS Ground Advantage</div>\r\n          <div class=\"ff-quicklink-btn\">View ➔</div>\r\n        </a>\r\n        <a href=\"#chinh-sach-fulfillment\" class=\"ff-quicklink-card\">\r\n          <div class=\"ff-quicklink-title\">Service policy</div>\r\n          <div class=\"ff-quicklink-sub\">Storage, order handling, and shipping terms</div>\r\n          <div class=\"ff-quicklink-btn\">View ➔</div>\r\n        </a>\r\n        <a href=\"https://hub.speegologistic.com\" class=\"ff-quicklink-card ff-quicklink-card--hub\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\r\n          <div class=\"ff-quicklink-title\">Hub System</div>\r\n          <div class=\"ff-quicklink-sub\">Access SpeeGo’s operations management portal</div>\r\n          <div class=\"ff-quicklink-btn\">Open ➔</div>\r\n        </a>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <!-- 2. 5-STEP PROCESS SECTION (DARK NAVY) -->\r\n  <section class=\"ff-process-section\">\r\n    <div class=\"container\">\r\n      <div class=\"ff-section-header\">\r\n        <span class=\"ff-tag-eyebrow ff-tag-light\">FULFILLMENT WORKFLOW</span>\r\n        <h2 class=\"ff-section-title ff-title-white\">Five steps. One US-standard workflow.</h2>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"ff-steps-grid\">\r\n        <!-- Step 01 -->\r\n        <div class=\"ff-step-item\">\r\n          <div class=\"ff-step-num\">01</div>\r\n          <h3 class=\"ff-step-name\">Barcode setup</h3>\r\n          <p class=\"ff-step-text\">Create or assign a barcode for each product. Barcode PDF files provided on request.</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <!-- Step 02 -->\r\n        <div class=\"ff-step-item\">\r\n          <div class=\"ff-step-num\">02</div>\r\n          <h3 class=\"ff-step-name\">Inbound request (IR)</h3>\r\n          <p class=\"ff-step-text\">Create an inbound request in the OMS: pick SKUs and quantities. The OMS confirms and returns an IR code to print and attach to each package.</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <!-- Step 03 -->\r\n        <div class=\"ff-step-item\">\r\n          <div class=\"ff-step-num\">03</div>\r\n          <h3 class=\"ff-step-name\">Receiving, inspection &amp; put-away</h3>\r\n          <p class=\"ff-step-text\">Every shipment is inspected before put-away. Inventory updates automatically in the OMS in real time.</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <!-- Step 04 -->\r\n        <div class=\"ff-step-item\">\r\n          <div class=\"ff-step-num\">04</div>\r\n          <h3 class=\"ff-step-name\">Fulfillment &amp; shipping</h3>\r\n          <p class=\"ff-step-text\">Orders are picked, packed with video records, and shipped via USPS, UPS, or FedEx.</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <!-- Step 05 -->\r\n        <div class=\"ff-step-item\">\r\n          <div class=\"ff-step-num\">05</div>\r\n          <h3 class=\"ff-step-name\">Returns handling</h3>\r\n          <p class=\"ff-step-text\">SpeeGo handles the full returns intake and processing workflow, free of charge on every order.</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"ff-process-cta\">\r\n        <a href=\"#contact-form\" class=\"btn-orange\">\r\n          Discuss the workflow ↗\r\n        </a>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <!-- 3. RATE CARD SECTION (demo-matched SpeeGo Fulfillment rate card) -->\r\n  <section class=\"ff-pricing-section ff-pricing-catalog\" id=\"bang-gia-fulfillment\">\r\n    <div class=\"container\">\r\n      <div class=\"ff-section-header\">\r\n        <span class=\"ff-tag-eyebrow\">US SERVICE PRICING</span>\r\n        <h2 class=\"ff-section-title\">SpeeGo Fulfillment rate card</h2>\r\n        <p class=\"ff-section-sub\">Rates are compiled from the Fulfill pricing sheet and the warehouse handling sheet. Open each group for details.</p>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <nav class=\"ff-pricing-jump\" aria-label=\"Pricing navigation\">\r\n        <a href=\"#fulfillment-cost\">Fulfill pricing</a>\r\n        <a href=\"#warehouse-handling\">Warehouse handling</a>\r\n        <a href=\"#shipping-rates\">USPS Ground Advantage</a>\r\n      </nav>\r\n\r\n      <section class=\"ff-pricing-sheet\" id=\"fulfillment-cost\">\r\n        <header class=\"ff-sheet-heading\">\r\n          <div>\r\n            <small>01 · FULFILL PRICING</small>\r\n            <h3>Fulfillment &amp; order handling</h3>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <span>3 service groups</span>\r\n        </header>\r\n        <div class=\"ff-plan-strip\">\r\n          <article>\r\n            <small>ALL-IN-ONE · UNDER 800 G/ORDER</small>\r\n            <b>Order handling + packaging + shipping</b>\r\n            <strong>$7<em>/order</em></strong>\r\n          </article>\r\n          <article>\r\n            <small>ALL-IN-ONE · 800 G TO UNDER 2.5 KG/ORDER</small>\r\n            <b>Order handling + packaging + shipping</b>\r\n            <strong>$10<em>/order</em></strong>\r\n          </article>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <details class=\"ff-price-group\" id=\"ff-outbound-rates\">\r\n  <summary><span><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>OUTBOUND HANDLING</span><small>8 items</small></summary>\r\n  <div class=\"ff-price-body\"><div class=\"ff-price-subhead\">ORDER HANDLING RATES · US</div>\r\n<div class=\"ff-price-row\">\r\n  <div>\r\n    <b>0–5 lb <span>(incl. 5 lb)</span></b>\r\n    <small>0–2.5 kg · All-in-one price</small>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <strong>By agreement</strong>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ff-price-note\">Orders over 2.5 kg are charged on the rates below. Fee uses actual or volumetric weight, whichever is greater.</div>\r\n<div class=\"ff-price-row\">\r\n  <div>\r\n    <b>5–15 lb <span>(incl. 15 lb)</span></b>\r\n    <small>&gt;2.5–6.75 kg</small>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <strong>$2.50 <em>/order</em></strong>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ff-price-row\">\r\n  <div>\r\n    <b>15–30 lb <span>(incl. 30 lb)</span></b>\r\n    <small>6.75–13.5 kg</small>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <strong>$3.25 <em>/order</em></strong>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ff-price-row\">\r\n  <div>\r\n    <b>30–50 lb <span>(incl. 50 lb)</span></b>\r\n    <small>13.5–22.5 kg</small>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <strong>$4.50 <em>/order</em></strong>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ff-price-row\">\r\n  <div>\r\n    <b>50–70 lb <span>(incl. 70 lb)</span></b>\r\n    <small>22.5–31.5 kg</small>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <strong>$6.35 <em>/order</em></strong>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ff-price-row\">\r\n  <div>\r\n    <b>70–100 lb <span>(incl. 100 lb)</span></b>\r\n    <small>31.5–45 kg</small>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <strong>$7.75 <em>/order</em></strong>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ff-price-row\">\r\n  <div>\r\n    <b>100–150 lb <span>(incl. 150 lb)</span></b>\r\n    <small>45–68 kg</small>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <strong>$10 <em>/order</em></strong>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ff-price-row\">\r\n  <div>\r\n    <b>Over 150 lb</b>\r\n    <small>Over 68 kg</small>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <strong>AT COST</strong>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ff-price-footnote\">Volumetric weight = L × W × H (cm) / 5,000.</div></div>\r\n</details>\r\n        <details class=\"ff-price-group ff-packaging-showcase-group\">\r\n  <summary><span><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>PACKAGING &amp; MATERIALS</span><small>5 options</small></summary>\r\n  <div class=\"ff-packaging-showcase\">\r\n    <div class=\"ff-packaging-intro\"><small>PACKAGING</small><h4>Packaging &amp; box rates</h4><p>Choose the right packaging, or send your branded packaging to the SpeeGo warehouse.</p></div>\r\n    <div class=\"ff-packaging-grid\">\r\n      <article class=\"ff-packaging-card\"><h5>Poly mailer</h5><strong class=\"ff-package-badge\">Free</strong><p>Included on every bagged order — no extra charge.</p></article>\r\n      <article class=\"ff-packaging-card\"><h5>Bubble mailer</h5><strong>$0.50<em>/mailer</em></strong><p>Cushioned protection for small, easily dented items.</p></article>\r\n      <article class=\"ff-packaging-card\"><h5>Bubble wrap</h5><strong>$0.50<em>/meter</em></strong><p>Extra shock protection, charged per meter used.</p></article>\r\n      <article class=\"ff-packaging-card\"><h5>Carton box</h5><dl><div><dt>8 × 8 × 8 in</dt><dd>$1.00</dd></div><div><dt>10 × 6 × 4 in</dt><dd>$1.50</dd></div><div><dt>9 × 7 × 3 in</dt><dd>$1.70</dd></div></dl><p>Three sizes in stock. Other sizes quoted on request.</p></article>\r\n      <article class=\"ff-packaging-card\"><h5>Your own packaging</h5><strong class=\"ff-package-badge\">No handling fee</strong><p>Send your branded packaging — SpeeGo receives, stores, and uses it at no extra cost.</p></article>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</details>\r\n      </section>\r\n\r\n      <section class=\"ff-pricing-sheet\" id=\"warehouse-handling\">\r\n        <header class=\"ff-sheet-heading\">\r\n          <div>\r\n            <small>02 · WAREHOUSE HANDLING</small>\r\n            <h3>Warehouse services &amp; returns</h3>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <span>4 service groups</span>\r\n        </header>\r\n        <details class=\"ff-price-group\">\r\n  <summary><span><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>UNLOADING FEES</span><small>4 items</small></summary>\r\n  <div class=\"ff-price-body\"><div class=\"ff-price-row\">\r\n  <div>\r\n    <b>Pallet</b>\r\n    <small>1 m × 1.2 m × 1.2 m</small>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <strong>$35 <em>/pallet</em></strong>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ff-price-row\">\r\n  <div>\r\n    <b>Container 20GP</b>\r\n    \r\n  </div>\r\n  <strong>$450 <em>/container</em></strong>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ff-price-row\">\r\n  <div>\r\n    <b>Container 40HQ</b>\r\n    \r\n  </div>\r\n  <strong>$510 <em>/container</em></strong>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ff-price-row\">\r\n  <div>\r\n    <b>Container 45HQ</b>\r\n    \r\n  </div>\r\n  <strong>$590 <em>/container</em></strong>\r\n</div></div>\r\n</details>\r\n        <details class=\"ff-price-group\">\r\n  <summary><span><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>RETURN FEES</span><small>3 items</small></summary>\r\n  <div class=\"ff-price-body\"><div class=\"ff-price-row\">\r\n  <div>\r\n    <b>0 &lt; X ≤ 2.5 kg</b>\r\n    <small>Receive return and restock</small>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <strong class=\"ff-free-price\">Free</strong>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ff-price-row\">\r\n  <div>\r\n    <b>5 &lt; X ≤ 10 kg</b>\r\n    \r\n  </div>\r\n  <strong>$12 <em>/package</em></strong>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ff-price-row\">\r\n  <div>\r\n    <b>10 &lt; X ≤ 20 kg</b>\r\n    \r\n  </div>\r\n  <strong>$15 <em>/package</em></strong>\r\n</div></div>\r\n</details>\r\n        <details class=\"ff-price-group\">\r\n  <summary><span><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>STORAGE FEES</span><small>5 time tiers</small></summary>\r\n  <div class=\"ff-price-body\"><div class=\"ff-price-promo\"><div><b>Volume condition</b><small>Storage fee $500/month if volume is under 200 orders/month.</small></div><span>NOTE</span></div>\r\n<div class=\"ff-price-row\">\r\n  <div>\r\n    <b>30–60 days</b>\r\n    \r\n  </div>\r\n  <strong>$1 <em>/CBM/day</em></strong>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ff-price-row\">\r\n  <div>\r\n    <b>61–90 days</b>\r\n    \r\n  </div>\r\n  <strong>$1.45 <em>/CBM/day</em></strong>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ff-price-row\">\r\n  <div>\r\n    <b>91–180 days</b>\r\n    \r\n  </div>\r\n  <strong>$1.80 <em>/CBM/day</em></strong>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ff-price-row\">\r\n  <div>\r\n    <b>181–360 days</b>\r\n    \r\n  </div>\r\n  <strong>$2 <em>/CBM/day</em></strong>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ff-price-row\">\r\n  <div>\r\n    <b>Over 360 days</b>\r\n    \r\n  </div>\r\n  <strong>$4 <em>/CBM/day</em></strong>\r\n</div></div>\r\n</details>\r\n        <details class=\"ff-price-group\">\r\n  <summary><span><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>WAREHOUSE SERVICES</span><small>6 items</small></summary>\r\n  <div class=\"ff-price-body\"><div class=\"ff-price-row\">\r\n  <div>\r\n    <b>Inbound counting</b>\r\n    <small>Count by carton under 21 kg</small>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <strong class=\"ff-free-price\">Free</strong>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ff-price-row\">\r\n  <div>\r\n    <b>Count &amp; sort by product</b>\r\n    <small>Carton under 2 SKUs</small>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <strong>$0.08 <em>/item</em></strong>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ff-price-row\">\r\n  <div>\r\n    <b>Count &amp; sort by product</b>\r\n    <small>Carton over 2 SKUs</small>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <strong>$0.10 <em>/item</em></strong>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ff-price-row\">\r\n  <div>\r\n    <b>Recount while selling</b>\r\n    <small>Per inventory count schedule</small>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <strong>See file</strong>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ff-price-row\">\r\n  <div>\r\n    <b>Basic disposal</b>\r\n    <small>With photos proving defect; periodic process</small>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <strong>Case by case</strong>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"ff-price-row\">\r\n  <div>\r\n    <b>Special disposal handling</b>\r\n    <small>Labeling, video, or custom handling</small>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <strong>$30–$50 <em>/job</em><small>About $25/hour</small></strong>\r\n</div></div>\r\n</details>\r\n      </section>\r\n\r\n      <section class=\"ff-pricing-sheet\" id=\"shipping-rates\">\r\n        <header class=\"ff-sheet-heading\">\r\n          <div>\r\n            <small>03 · USPS GROUND ADVANTAGE</small>\r\n            <h3>Shipping rates by zone</h3>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <span>Reference</span>\r\n        </header>\r\n        <details class=\"ff-price-group\">\r\n          <summary><span><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i>ZONE RATE TABLE</span><small>5 weight rows</small></summary>\r\n          <div class=\"ff-price-body ff-usps-body\"><div class=\"ff-usps-scroll\">\r\n  <table class=\"ff-usps-table\">\r\n    <thead><tr><th>lbs</th><th>ZONE 1</th><th>ZONE 2</th><th>ZONE 3</th><th>ZONE 4</th><th>ZONE 5</th><th>ZONE 6</th><th>ZONE 7</th><th>ZONE 8</th><th>ZONE 9</th></tr></thead>\r\n    <tbody>\r\n      <tr><th>1 lbs</th><td>$5.76</td><td>$5.98</td><td>$6.21</td><td>$6.54</td><td>$6.98</td><td>$7.55</td><td>$8.05</td><td>$8.52</td><td>$8.52</td></tr>\r\n      <tr><th>2 lbs</th><td>$6.35</td><td>$6.68</td><td>$7.05</td><td>$7.55</td><td>$8.25</td><td>$9.05</td><td>$9.85</td><td>$10.55</td><td>$10.55</td></tr>\r\n      <tr><th>3 lbs</th><td>$6.95</td><td>$7.45</td><td>$7.95</td><td>$8.65</td><td>$9.65</td><td>$10.75</td><td>$11.85</td><td>$12.85</td><td>$12.85</td></tr>\r\n      <tr><th>5 lbs</th><td>$8.15</td><td>$8.95</td><td>$9.75</td><td>$10.95</td><td>$12.55</td><td>$14.25</td><td>$15.95</td><td>$17.55</td><td>$17.55</td></tr>\r\n      <tr><th>10 lbs</th><td>$11.25</td><td>$12.85</td><td>$14.55</td><td>$17.25</td><td>$20.85</td><td>$24.55</td><td>$28.15</td><td>$31.55</td><td>$31.55</td></tr>\r\n    </tbody>\r\n  </table>\r\n</div>\r\n<p class=\"ff-price-footnote\">* Shipping rates include an 8% USPS fuel surcharge.</p></div>\r\n        </details>\r\n      </section>\r\n\r\n      <p class=\"ff-pricing-disclaimer\">Rates are indicative SpeeGo pricing. Special requests and extras are confirmed before processing.</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <!-- 4. FULFILLMENT COST ESTIMATOR -->\r\n  <section class=\"ff-calc-section\" id=\"uoc-tinh-chi-phi\">\r\n    <div class=\"container\">\r\n      <div class=\"ff-estimator\" id=\"cost-estimator\">\r\n        <div class=\"ff-estimator-heading\">\r\n          <div>\r\n            <small>FULFILLMENT COST ESTIMATE</small>\r\n            <p>Outbound handling + packaging + carrier</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <span aria-hidden=\"true\">▦</span>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div class=\"ff-estimator-body\">\r\n          <form class=\"ff-estimator-form\" aria-label=\"Fulfillment cost estimate\">\r\n            <div class=\"ff-estimate-guide\">\r\n              <span>01</span>\r\n              <div>\r\n                <strong>Order details</strong>\r\n                <small>Enter weight, choose delivery zone and packaging.</small>\r\n              </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n            <label class=\"ff-estimate-field\">Weight (lbs)\r\n              <input type=\"number\" id=\"calcWeight\" min=\"0.1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"1\" inputmode=\"decimal\">\r\n            </label>\r\n            <label class=\"ff-estimate-field\">Zone\r\n              <select id=\"calcZone\">\r\n                <option value=\"1\" selected>Zone 1</option>\r\n                <option value=\"2\">Zone 2</option>\r\n                <option value=\"3\">Zone 3</option>\r\n                <option value=\"4\">Zone 4</option>\r\n                <option value=\"5\">Zone 5</option>\r\n                <option value=\"6\">Zone 6</option>\r\n                <option value=\"7\">Zone 7</option>\r\n                <option value=\"8\">Zone 8</option>\r\n                <option value=\"9\">Zone 9</option>\r\n              </select>\r\n            </label>\r\n\r\n            <fieldset class=\"ff-shipping-choice\">\r\n              <legend>Shipping label</legend>\r\n              <label class=\"ff-package-option ff-shipping-option\">\r\n                <input id=\"useSpeegoLabel\" type=\"checkbox\" checked>\r\n                <span>\r\n                  <b>Use SpeeGo’s USPS label</b>\r\n                  <small id=\"shippingChoiceStatus\">In use</small>\r\n                </span>\r\n              </label>\r\n              <p>Uncheck if the customer provides their own tracking or shipping label.</p>\r\n            </fieldset>\r\n\r\n            <fieldset class=\"ff-package-choice\">\r\n              <legend>Packaging</legend>\r\n              <div class=\"ff-package-options\">\r\n                <label class=\"ff-package-option\">\r\n                  <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"estimate-packaging\" data-package=\"poly\" value=\"0\" checked>\r\n                  <span><b>Poly mailer</b><small>Free</small></span>\r\n                </label>\r\n                <label class=\"ff-package-option\">\r\n                  <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"estimate-packaging\" data-package=\"seller\" value=\"0\">\r\n                  <span><b>Seller packaging</b><small>Free handling</small></span>\r\n                </label>\r\n                <label class=\"ff-package-option ff-quantity-package\">\r\n                  <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"estimate-packaging\" data-package=\"bubble-wrap\" value=\"0.15\">\r\n                  <span>\r\n                    <b>Bubble wrap</b><small>$0.15/item</small>\r\n                    <i class=\"ff-quantity-editor\"><em>Qty</em>\r\n                      <input type=\"number\" class=\"ff-package-quantity\" data-quantity-for=\"bubble-wrap\" min=\"1\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\" inputmode=\"numeric\" aria-label=\"Bubble wrap quantity\">\r\n                    </i>\r\n                  </span>\r\n                </label>\r\n                <label class=\"ff-package-option ff-quantity-package\">\r\n                  <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"estimate-packaging\" data-package=\"bubble-mailer\" value=\"0.5\">\r\n                  <span>\r\n                    <b>Bubble mailer</b><small>$0.50/bag</small>\r\n                    <i class=\"ff-quantity-editor\"><em>Qty</em>\r\n                      <input type=\"number\" class=\"ff-package-quantity\" data-quantity-for=\"bubble-mailer\" min=\"1\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\" inputmode=\"numeric\" aria-label=\"Bubble mailer quantity\">\r\n                    </i>\r\n                  </span>\r\n                </label>\r\n                <label class=\"ff-package-option\">\r\n                  <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"estimate-packaging\" data-package=\"carton\" value=\"1\">\r\n                  <span><b>Carton box</b><small>From $1.00</small></span>\r\n                </label>\r\n              </div>\r\n            </fieldset>\r\n          </form>\r\n\r\n          <aside class=\"ff-estimate-result\" aria-live=\"polite\">\r\n            <small>BILLABLE WEIGHT</small>\r\n            <strong id=\"calcResultWeight\">1.00 lbs</strong>\r\n            <dl>\r\n              <div><dt>Outbound handling</dt><dd id=\"calcResultAio\">$7.00</dd></div>\r\n              <div><dt>Packaging</dt><dd id=\"calcResultPkg\">Included</dd></div>\r\n              <div><dt>Carrier</dt><dd id=\"calcResultShip\">Included</dd></div>\r\n            </dl>\r\n            <div class=\"ff-estimate-total\">\r\n              <span>ESTIMATED TOTAL</span>\r\n              <b id=\"calcResultTotal\">$7.00</b>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <p id=\"calcEstimateNote\">Orders up to 800g with SpeeGo’s USPS label use the all-in-one $7 rate. Estimate for reference only.</p>\r\n            <div class=\"ff-estimate-brand\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\r\n              <img src=\"assets/speego-logo-dark.png\" alt=\"\">\r\n            </div>\r\n          </aside>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <!-- 5. INSIDE HOUSTON WAREHOUSE -->\r\n  <section class=\"ff-warehouse-section\">\r\n    <div class=\"container\">\r\n      <div class=\"ff-warehouse-header\">\r\n        <div>\r\n          <span class=\"ff-tag-eyebrow\">INSIDE THE WAREHOUSE</span>\r\n          <h2 class=\"ff-section-title\">Inside the Houston warehouse.</h2>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"ff-warehouse-cards-grid\" id=\"warehouseGallery\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Houston warehouse photos\" tabindex=\"0\">\r\n        <article class=\"ff-warehouse-card\">\r\n          <img src=\"assets/houston_warehouse_ops.jpg\" alt=\"Houston warehouse operations floor\" class=\"ff-warehouse-card-img\" loading=\"lazy\">\r\n          <div class=\"ff-warehouse-card-caption\">\r\n            <h3 class=\"ff-warehouse-card-title\">Warehouse operations</h3>\r\n            <p class=\"ff-warehouse-card-text\">Organized work areas for receiving, storage, and order handling.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n\r\n        <article class=\"ff-warehouse-card\">\r\n          <img src=\"assets/houston_warehouse_hero.jpg\" alt=\"Houston SpeeGo warehouse facility\" class=\"ff-warehouse-card-img\" loading=\"lazy\">\r\n          <div class=\"ff-warehouse-card-caption\">\r\n            <h3 class=\"ff-warehouse-card-title\">Houston facility</h3>\r\n            <p class=\"ff-warehouse-card-text\">SpeeGo’s US warehouse supporting fulfillment across markets.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n\r\n        <article class=\"ff-warehouse-card\">\r\n          <img src=\"assets/warehouse_racks_hero.jpg\" alt=\"Houston warehouse storage racks\" class=\"ff-warehouse-card-img\" loading=\"lazy\">\r\n          <div class=\"ff-warehouse-card-caption\">\r\n            <h3 class=\"ff-warehouse-card-title\">Storage racks</h3>\r\n            <p class=\"ff-warehouse-card-text\">Secure shelving for inventory ready to pick and pack.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n\r\n        <article class=\"ff-warehouse-card\">\r\n          <img src=\"assets/factory_staging_dispatch.jpg\" alt=\"Houston warehouse order staging area\" class=\"ff-warehouse-card-img\" loading=\"lazy\">\r\n          <div class=\"ff-warehouse-card-caption\">\r\n            <h3 class=\"ff-warehouse-card-title\">Order staging</h3>\r\n            <p class=\"ff-warehouse-card-text\">Packages prepared for dispatch and carrier handoff.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </article>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <!-- 6. SERVICE POLICY SECTION -->\r\n  <section class=\"ff-policy-section\" id=\"chinh-sach-fulfillment\">\r\n    <div class=\"container\">\r\n      <header class=\"ff-policy-heading\">\r\n        <div>\r\n          <p class=\"ff-tag-eyebrow\">SERVICE POLICY</p>\r\n          <h2 class=\"ff-section-title\">Fulfillment policy</h2>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <p>\r\n          Each case below is assessed from the order record, valid documentation, and the reconciliation between the customer, the SpeeGo warehouse, and the carrier.\r\n        </p>\r\n      </header>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"ff-policy-list\">\r\n        <details class=\"ff-policy-item\">\r\n          <summary class=\"ff-policy-header\">\r\n            <span class=\"ff-policy-num\">01</span>\r\n            <strong class=\"ff-policy-title\">Goods lost in the warehouse</strong>\r\n            <i class=\"ff-policy-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</i>\r\n          </summary>\r\n          <div class=\"ff-policy-content\">\r\n            <p><b>Eligibility:</b> Goods were received into inventory correctly but were lost while in storage.</p>\r\n            <p><b>Compensation:</b> If an entire lot is lost, SpeeGo reimburses 100% of the merchandise cost and shipping fees when the customer provides complete valid documentation.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </details>\r\n\r\n        <details class=\"ff-policy-item\">\r\n          <summary class=\"ff-policy-header\">\r\n            <span class=\"ff-policy-num\">02</span>\r\n            <strong class=\"ff-policy-title\">Incorrect packing by the warehouse</strong>\r\n            <i class=\"ff-policy-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</i>\r\n          </summary>\r\n          <div class=\"ff-policy-content\">\r\n            <p><b>Warehouse error:</b> Staff packed the wrong SKU. SpeeGo covers the cost of reshipping to the buyer and reimburses 100% of merchandise cost, up to <b>$20/item</b>.</p>\r\n            <p><b>Customer data error:</b> If the wrong SKU results from the customer printing or applying an incorrect product barcode, SpeeGo has no compensation obligation.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </details>\r\n\r\n        <details class=\"ff-policy-item\">\r\n          <summary class=\"ff-policy-header\">\r\n            <span class=\"ff-policy-num\">03</span>\r\n            <strong class=\"ff-policy-title\">Wrong label or delivery address</strong>\r\n            <i class=\"ff-policy-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</i>\r\n          </summary>\r\n          <div class=\"ff-policy-content\">\r\n            <p><b>Failed delivery:</b> If the address is missing or the warehouse entered incorrect information / printed or applied the wrong label, SpeeGo covers the cost of reshipping the order.</p>\r\n            <p><b>Wrong address delivery:</b> If the error originated in the warehouse, SpeeGo reships free of charge and reimburses 100% of merchandise cost, up to <b>$3/item</b>.</p>\r\n            <p><b>Customer cancels before reship:</b> Fulfillment and shipping fees for that order are refunded.</p>\r\n            <p class=\"ff-policy-exclusion\"><b>Note:</b> If the seller provided inaccurate information, SpeeGo has no compensation obligation.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </details>\r\n\r\n        <details class=\"ff-policy-item\">\r\n          <summary class=\"ff-policy-header\">\r\n            <span class=\"ff-policy-num\">04</span>\r\n            <strong class=\"ff-policy-title\">Damage during packing or domestic transit</strong>\r\n            <i class=\"ff-policy-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</i>\r\n          </summary>\r\n          <div class=\"ff-policy-content\">\r\n            <p><b>Warehouse packing error:</b> If a packing error causes a refund, SpeeGo refunds 100% of fulfillment and shipping fees and supports reimbursement of 100% of merchandise cost, up to <b>$20/order</b>.</p>\r\n            <p><b>Damage in transit:</b> If the warehouse packed as agreed, SpeeGo helps the customer reconcile with USPS, UPS, or FedEx to file a claim.</p>\r\n            <p class=\"ff-policy-exclusion\"><b>Exclusion:</b> No compensation when the customer requested minimal packing to reduce cost and accepted the risk.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </details>\r\n\r\n        <details class=\"ff-policy-item\">\r\n          <summary class=\"ff-policy-header\">\r\n            <span class=\"ff-policy-num\">05</span>\r\n            <strong class=\"ff-policy-title\">Marked “Delivered” but not received</strong>\r\n            <i class=\"ff-policy-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</i>\r\n          </summary>\r\n          <div class=\"ff-policy-content\">\r\n            <p><b>Eligibility:</b> Applies to orders that require a signature. The customer must help gather information from the buyer and support the reconciliation process.</p>\r\n            <p><b>Handling:</b> SpeeGo reconciles with USPS, UPS, or FedEx. If the carrier confirms loss, the claim follows the carrier’s policy.</p>\r\n            <p class=\"ff-policy-exclusion\"><b>Exclusion:</b> If status remains “Delivered” and the carrier does not confirm loss, SpeeGo has no compensation obligation.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </details>\r\n\r\n        <details class=\"ff-policy-item\">\r\n          <summary class=\"ff-policy-header\">\r\n            <span class=\"ff-policy-num\">06</span>\r\n            <strong class=\"ff-policy-title\">Orders shipped later than the SLA</strong>\r\n            <i class=\"ff-policy-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">+</i>\r\n          </summary>\r\n          <div class=\"ff-policy-content\">\r\n            <p><b>Eligibility:</b> A fulfillment tracking number was created but the order was not shipped within <b>3 business days</b>, excluding U.S. weekends and holidays.</p>\r\n            <p><b>Handling:</b> If warehouse processing exceeds the SLA by more than 3 business days, SpeeGo refunds 100% of the fulfillment fee for that order.</p>\r\n            <p class=\"ff-policy-exclusion\"><b>Exclusion:</b> If the warehouse handed the order to USPS, UPS, or FedEx within SLA but the delay occurred in transit, SpeeGo is not liable for compensation.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </details>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <aside class=\"ff-claim-policy\">\r\n        <div>\r\n          <small>FILING A CLAIM</small>\r\n          <h3>Submission deadlines</h3>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <ul>\r\n          <li><b>Lost orders:</b> Within 2 months of the carrier accepting the order.</li>\r\n          <li><b>Damage, incorrect rates, or issues with the goods:</b> Within 3 days of delivery to the recipient.</li>\r\n        </ul>\r\n        <div class=\"ff-claim-time\">\r\n          <small>PROCESSING TIME</small>\r\n          <strong>10 business days</strong>\r\n          <span>Counted from receipt of the complete claim file during transit.</span>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </aside>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <!-- 7. CONSULTATION FORM BAND -->\r\n  <div data-component=\"cta-form\" data-variant=\"band\" id=\"contact-form\"></div>\r\n\r\n  <!-- 8. FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS SECTION -->\r\n  <section class=\"ff-faq-section\">\r\n    <div class=\"container\">\r\n      <div class=\"ff-section-header\">\r\n        <span class=\"ff-tag-eyebrow\">HELPFUL INFORMATION</span>\r\n        <h2 class=\"ff-section-title\">Frequently asked questions</h2>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"ff-faq-list\">\r\n        <div class=\"ff-faq-item faq-item\">\r\n          <button class=\"ff-faq-btn faq-question-btn\">\r\n            <span>How do I create an inbound request?</span>\r\n            <span class=\"ff-faq-plus\">+</span>\r\n          </button>\r\n          <div class=\"ff-faq-answer\">\r\n            <p>Create an Inbound Request (IR) directly via SpeeGo OMS, select SKU quantities, and attach the system-generated IR shipping label to each carton before sending them to Houston.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"ff-faq-item faq-item\">\r\n          <button class=\"ff-faq-btn faq-question-btn\">\r\n            <span>How does SpeeGo support barcode setup?</span>\r\n            <span class=\"ff-faq-plus\">+</span>\r\n          </button>\r\n          <div class=\"ff-faq-answer\">\r\n            <p>SpeeGo supports generating standard international barcodes or adopting your existing product barcodes. We provide printable PDF templates and onsite labeling services at the warehouse.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"ff-faq-item faq-item\">\r\n          <button class=\"ff-faq-btn faq-question-btn\">\r\n            <span>Where can I track inventory and orders?</span>\r\n            <span class=\"ff-faq-plus\">+</span>\r\n          </button>\r\n          <div class=\"ff-faq-answer\">\r\n            <p>All stock levels, fulfillment milestones, and carrier tracking statuses are synced live 24/7 inside the SpeeGo online OMS portal.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"ff-faq-item faq-item\">\r\n          <button class=\"ff-faq-btn faq-question-btn\">\r\n            <span>Can I review how an order was packed?</span>\r\n            <span class=\"ff-faq-plus\">+</span>\r\n          </button>\r\n          <div class=\"ff-faq-answer\">\r\n            <p>Yes. SpeeGo packing stations are equipped with high-definition video recording indexed by tracking ID for complete transparency during claims reconciliation.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"ff-faq-item faq-item\">\r\n          <button class=\"ff-faq-btn faq-question-btn\">\r\n            <span>Which carriers handle orders?</span>\r\n            <span class=\"ff-faq-plus\">+</span>\r\n          </button>\r\n          <div class=\"ff-faq-answer\">\r\n            <p>SpeeGo partners directly with leading US tier-1 carriers: USPS (optimized via Ground Advantage), UPS, and FedEx.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"ff-faq-item faq-item\">\r\n          <button class=\"ff-faq-btn faq-question-btn\">\r\n            <span>How are returns handled?</span>\r\n            <span class=\"ff-faq-plus\">+</span>\r\n          </button>\r\n          <div class=\"ff-faq-answer\">\r\n            <p>When returns arrive at the Houston hub, our team inspects them, uploads photo reports to your OMS, and restocks eligible units into active inventory at no receiving charge.</p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <!-- 9. TESTIMONIAL SECTION -->\r\n  <section class=\"ff-testimonial-section\">\r\n    <div class=\"container\">\r\n      <div class=\"ff-section-header\">\r\n        <span class=\"ff-tag-eyebrow\">SPEEGO CUSTOMERS</span>\r\n        <h2 class=\"ff-section-title\">Working alongside your business</h2>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"testimonials-2col-grid\">\r\n        <div class=\"testimonial-card-sourcing\">\r\n          <div>\r\n            <div class=\"ff-quote-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-bottom: 16px;\"><span></span><span></span></div>\r\n            <blockquote class=\"ff-quote-text\" style=\"font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\r\n              “The real-time OMS tracking and zero-hidden-costs policy make SpeeGo our most reliable supply chain partner.”\r\n            </blockquote>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"ff-author-info\">\r\n            <div class=\"ff-author-name\">Sarah Mitchell</div>\r\n            <div class=\"ff-author-title\">Operations Director, EcoLiving Home · Australia</div>\r\n            <div class=\"ff-author-ref\"><a href=\"#/en/sourcing\" class=\"ff-ref-link\">As published on the SpeeGo website ↗</a></div>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div class=\"testimonial-card-sourcing\">\r\n          <div>\r\n            <div class=\"ff-quote-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-bottom: 16px;\"><span></span><span></span></div>\r\n            <blockquote class=\"ff-quote-text\" style=\"font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\r\n              “The on-site QC team saved us thousands of dollars before the container was sealed.”\r\n            </blockquote>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div class=\"ff-author-info\">\r\n            <div class=\"ff-author-name\">Kevin Le</div>\r\n            <div class=\"ff-author-title\">CEO, Glamour Nail Supplies · California, USA</div>\r\n            <div class=\"ff-author-ref\"><a href=\"#/en/sourcing\" class=\"ff-ref-link\">As published on the SpeeGo website ↗</a></div>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n','[Dịch vụ EN] SpeeGo Fulfillment &amp; Warehouse Operations','','inherit','closed','closed','','27-revision-v1','','','2026-09-26 14:15:12','2026-09-26 14:15:12','',27,'http://localhost/wordpress_demo/?p=277',0,'revision','',0),(278,0,'2026-09-26 14:15:12','2026-09-26 14:15:12','\r\n\r\n<div class=\"page-container page-import-export\"\r\n     data-page=\"en-import-export\"\r\n     data-nav=\"import-export\"\r\n     data-breadcrumb=\'[{\"label\":\"Home\",\"href\":\"#/en/knowledge\"},{\"label\":\"Import & Export\",\"href\":\"#/en/import-export\"}]\'>\r\n\r\n  <!-- 1. HERO SECTION (2 COLUMNS: TEXT LEFT, CARD IMAGE RIGHT) -->\r\n  <section class=\"page-hero-2col\">\r\n    <div class=\"container\">\r\n      <div class=\"hero-2col-grid\">\r\n        <!-- Left Column: Title, Intro & Actions -->\r\n        <div class=\"hero-2col-left\">\r\n          <div class=\"hero-tag-bar\">IMPORT &amp; EXPORT</div>\r\n          <h1 class=\"hero-h1-clean\">\r\n            Import &amp; export<br>\r\n            <span class=\"text-orange\">made easier.</span>\r\n          </h1>\r\n          <p class=\"hero-desc-clean\">\r\n            Customs documentation, declaration, and compliance support at every step of your import and export journey. A single point of contact from preparation to clearance.\r\n          </p>\r\n          <div class=\"hero-actions-row\">\r\n            <a href=\"#contact-form\" class=\"btn-orange\">\r\n              Discuss Your Needs ↗\r\n            </a>\r\n            <a href=\"tel:+84906828898\" class=\"hero-phone-label\">\r\n              (+84) 906 828 898\r\n            </a>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Right Column: Card Device Image with SpeeGo Caption -->\r\n        <div class=\"hero-2col-right\">\r\n          <div class=\"hero-img-card-wrap\">\r\n            <img src=\"assets/import-export-consultation.png\" alt=\"Clear documentation. Seamless process.\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; this.src=\'assets/warehouse_hero.jpg\';\">\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <!-- 2. CORE SERVICES CARDS -->\r\n  <section class=\"ie-services-section\">\r\n    <div class=\"container\">\r\n      <div class=\"section-header\">\r\n        <span class=\"section-tag\">CORE SERVICES</span>\r\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\">Solutions for every import &amp; export requirement.</h2>\r\n        <p class=\"ie-services-lead\">Comprehensive support from consultation to certification, ensuring smooth and compliant import–export operations.</p>\r\n      </div>\r\n      <div class=\"ie-service-grid\">\r\n        <article class=\"ie-service-card-new\">\r\n          <div class=\"ie-service-card-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"ie-service-index\" aria-hidden=\"true\">01</span>\r\n            <span class=\"ie-service-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\r\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"3.4\"/><path d=\"M5.5 20c.4-3.1 2.9-5.2 6.5-5.2 1.2 0 2.2.2 3.1.7\"/><path d=\"M16.5 4.5h5v5h-2l-2 2v-2h-1z\"/></svg>\r\n            </span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <h3 class=\"ie-service-title\">Customs Consultation</h3>\r\n          <p class=\"ie-service-description\">Consultation on HS codes, product policies, duties, and customs documentation.</p>\r\n          <img class=\"ie-service-card-image\" src=\"assets/import-export-consultation.png\" alt=\"Customs consultation\" loading=\"lazy\">\r\n        </article>\r\n        <article class=\"ie-service-card-new\">\r\n          <div class=\"ie-service-card-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"ie-service-index\" aria-hidden=\"true\">02</span>\r\n            <span class=\"ie-service-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\r\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M3 16.5h18l-2.4 3H6z\"/><path d=\"M6 15.5l2.4-5h7.2l2.4 5M12 10V4m0 0L9.5 6.5M12 4l2.5 2.5\"/><path d=\"M4 21h16\"/></svg>\r\n            </span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <h3 class=\"ie-service-title\">Import &amp; Export Clearance</h3>\r\n          <p class=\"ie-service-description\">End-to-end customs clearance execution for import and export shipments.</p>\r\n          <img class=\"ie-service-card-image\" src=\"assets/port_sunset_hero.jpg\" alt=\"Cargo ship and port for customs clearance\" loading=\"lazy\">\r\n        </article>\r\n        <article class=\"ie-service-card-new\">\r\n          <div class=\"ie-service-card-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"ie-service-index\" aria-hidden=\"true\">03</span>\r\n            <span class=\"ie-service-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\r\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"3.5\" width=\"14\" height=\"17\" rx=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M9 8h6m-6 4h6m-6 4h3\"/><path d=\"m16.5 14.5 1.3 1.3 2.7-3\"/></svg>\r\n            </span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <h3 class=\"ie-service-title\">Specialized Inspection</h3>\r\n          <p class=\"ie-service-description\">Support for specialized inspection and quality verification based on cargo classification.</p>\r\n          <img class=\"ie-service-card-image\" src=\"assets/factory_packaging_qc.jpg\" alt=\"Specialized product inspection\" loading=\"lazy\">\r\n        </article>\r\n        <article class=\"ie-service-card-new\">\r\n          <div class=\"ie-service-card-top\">\r\n            <span class=\"ie-service-index\" aria-hidden=\"true\">04</span>\r\n            <span class=\"ie-service-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\r\n              <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 3h8l4 4v10H7z\"/><path d=\"M15 3v5h4M10 11h6m-6 3h6\"/><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"18\" r=\"3\"/><path d=\"m7.5 20.5-.5 2 2-1 2 1-.5-2\"/></svg>\r\n            </span>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <h3 class=\"ie-service-title\">Certificate of Origin (C/O)</h3>\r\n          <p class=\"ie-service-description\">Support for issuance of Certificate of Origin (C/O) and related documentation.</p>\r\n          <img class=\"ie-service-card-image\" src=\"assets/factory_staging_dispatch.jpg\" alt=\"Export goods prepared for documentation\" loading=\"lazy\">\r\n        </article>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <!-- 3. WHY CHOOSE SPEEGO (4 CARDS LIGHT GRAY BACKGROUND) -->\r\n  <section class=\"ie-why-section\">\r\n    <div class=\"container\">\r\n      <div class=\"section-header\">\r\n        <span class=\"section-tag\">WHY CHOOSE SPEEGO</span>\r\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\">\r\n          Understand the regulations. Proactively control risks.\r\n        </h2>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"ie-why-grid\">\r\n        <!-- Card 01 -->\r\n        <div class=\"ie-service-card\">\r\n          <div class=\"ie-badge-box\">01</div>\r\n          <h3 class=\"ie-card-h3\">Deep Customs Expertise</h3>\r\n          <p class=\"ie-card-body\">SpeeGo assists businesses in preparing documentation, customs declaration, and all required procedures for every shipment.</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Card 02 -->\r\n        <div class=\"ie-service-card\">\r\n          <div class=\"ie-badge-box\">02</div>\r\n          <h3 class=\"ie-card-h3\">Diverse Commodity Support</h3>\r\n          <p class=\"ie-card-body\">Advisory on import regulations, product policies, and specialized inspection requirements tailored to each cargo type.</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Card 03 -->\r\n        <div class=\"ie-service-card\">\r\n          <div class=\"ie-badge-box\">03</div>\r\n          <h3 class=\"ie-card-h3\">Customs Risk Management</h3>\r\n          <p class=\"ie-card-body\">Assistance in verifying paperwork, HS codes, and documentation to mitigate delays, requests for additional files, or unforeseen costs.</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <!-- Card 04 -->\r\n        <div class=\"ie-service-card\">\r\n          <div class=\"ie-badge-box\">04</div>\r\n          <h3 class=\"ie-card-h3\">End-to-End Assistance</h3>\r\n          <p class=\"ie-card-body\">From pre-import advisory, document preparation, and customs filing to final clearance, SpeeGo accompanies your business across the entire journey.</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <!-- 4. CONSULTATION FORM BAND -->\r\n  <div data-component=\"cta-form\" data-variant=\"band\" id=\"contact-form\"></div>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n','[Dịch vụ EN] SpeeGo Import &amp; Export (Customs Brokerage)','','inherit','closed','closed','','34-revision-v1','','','2026-09-26 14:15:12','2026-09-26 14:15:12','',34,'http://localhost/wordpress_demo/?p=278',0,'revision','',0),(279,0,'2026-09-26 14:15:12','2026-09-26 14:15:12','﻿<!-- ==========================================================================\r\n     PAGE: KNOWLEDGE HUB (ALL TOPICS) - ENGLISH\r\n     Metadata:\r\n     data-page=\"knowledge-en\"\r\n     data-nav=\"knowledge\"\r\n     data-breadcrumb=\'[{\"label\":\"Home\",\"href\":\"#/sourcing\"},{\"lab