l\">\r\n							<span class=\"speego-why-cell-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M9.5 6C6.5 7.6 5 10 5 12.8c0 2 1.2 3.4 3 3.4 1.6 0 2.7-1.1 2.7-2.6 0-1.4-1-2.4-2.3-2.4-.2 0-.4 0-.5.1.3-1.6 1.6-3 3.3-3.9L9.5 6Zm9 0c-3 1.6-4.5 4-4.5 6.8 0 2 1.2 3.4 3 3.4 1.6 0 2.7-1.1 2.7-2.6 0-1.4-1-2.4-2.3-2.4-.2 0-.4 0-.5.1.3-1.6 1.6-3 3.3-3.9L18.5 6Z\"/></svg></span>\r\n							<h3 class=\"speego-why-cell-title\" data-i18n=\"why6_title\">Tracking bằng hệ thống OMS</h3>\r\n							<p class=\"speego-why-cell-desc\" data-i18n=\"why6_desc\">Theo dõi tình trạng lô hàng nhanh chóng, thuận tiện và chính xác.</p>\r\n						</article>\r\n					</div>\r\n				</div>\r\n			</div>\r\n		</section>\r\n\r\n		<!-- =================================================================\r\n		     8/ TIN TỨC & THỊ TRƯỜNG (NEWS & INSIGHTS)\r\n		     ================================================================= -->\r\n		<section class=\"speego-section-alt speego-news-section\" id=\"news-speego\">\r\n			<div class=\"speego-news-inner\">\r\n				<div class=\"speego-news-header\">\r\n					<h2 class=\"speego-news-title\" data-i18n=\"news_title\">Latest Logistics &amp; Trade Insights</h2>\r\n					<a href=\"news/index.html\" class=\"speego-news-view-all\">\r\n						<span data-i18n=\"news_view_all\">View All</span>\r\n						<svg class=\"speego-news-view-all-arrow\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polyline points=\"9 18 15 12 9 6\"></polyline></svg>\r\n					</a>\r\n				</div>\r\n\r\n				<div class=\"speego-services-grid\">\r\n					<div class=\"speego-service-card\">\r\n						<div class=\"speego-service-thumb\">\r\n							<img src=\"assets/loaded-container-cargo-ship.jpg\" alt=\"Ocean freight trends\" loading=\"lazy\">\r\n						</div>\r\n						<div class=\"speego-service-body\">\r\n							<span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: var(--speego-accent); font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase;\" data-i18n=\"news1_cat\">Freight Market</span>\r\n							<h3 class=\"speego-service-title\" style=\"margin-top: 6px;\" data-i18n=\"news1_title\">Trans-Pacific Ocean Rates Outlook &amp; Peak Season Prep</h3>\r\n							<p class=\"speego-service-text\" data-i18n=\"news1_desc\">Key strategies for importers to secure vessel capacity and avoid port demurrage during peak Q3/Q4 shipping cycles.</p>\r\n							<a href=\"news/index.html\" class=\"speego-service-link\"><span data-i18n=\"news_read\">Read Analysis</span><svg class=\"speego-service-link-arrow\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polyline points=\"9 18 15 12 9 6\"></polyline></svg></a>\r\n						</div>\r\n					</div>\r\n\r\n					<div class=\"speego-service-card\">\r\n						<div class=\"speego-service-thumb\">\r\n							<img src=\"assets/global-logistic-airplane.jpg\" alt=\"Air Cargo\" loading=\"lazy\">\r\n						</div>\r\n						<div class=\"speego-service-body\">\r\n							<span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: var(--speego-accent); font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase;\" data-i18n=\"news2_cat\">Air Freight</span>\r\n							<h3 class=\"speego-service-title\" style=\"margin-top: 6px;\" data-i18n=\"news2_title\">Fast-Track Cosmetics &amp; E-Commerce Clearance in the US</h3>\r\n							<p class=\"speego-service-text\" data-i18n=\"news2_desc\">Understanding FDA prior notice, Section 321 exemptions, and expedited air customs declarations for rapid stock turn.</p>\r\n							<a href=\"news/index.html\" class=\"speego-service-link\"><span data-i18n=\"news_read\">Read Analysis</span><svg class=\"speego-service-link-arrow\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polyline points=\"9 18 15 12 9 6\"></polyline></svg></a>\r\n						</div>\r\n					</div>\r\n\r\n					<div class=\"speego-service-card\">\r\n						<div class=\"speego-service-thumb\">\r\n							<img src=\"assets/foreman-control-loading-containers.jpg\" alt=\"Factory Sourcing\" loading=\"lazy\">\r\n						</div>\r\n						<div class=\"speego-service-body\">\r\n							<span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: var(--speego-accent); font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase;\">Factory Sourcing</span>\r\n							<h3 class=\"speego-service-title\" style=\"margin-top: 6px;\">Navigating Low MOQs &amp; Production Audits in Vietnam</h3>\r\n							<p class=\"speego-service-text\">How small and mid-sized e-commerce enterprises can leverage Vietnam’s growing manufacturing hub for high-yield margins.</p>\r\n							<a href=\"news/index.html\" class=\"speego-service-link\"><span>Read Analysis</span><svg class=\"speego-service-link-arrow\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polyline points=\"9 18 15 12 9 6\"></polyline></svg></a>\r\n						</div>\r\n					</div>\r\n\r\n					<div class=\"speego-service-card\">\r\n						<div class=\"speego-service-thumb\">\r\n							<img src=\"assets/futuristic-truck.jpg\" alt=\"Technology in Logistics\" loading=\"lazy\">\r\n						</div>\r\n						<div class=\"speego-service-body\">\r\n							<span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: var(--speego-accent); font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase;\">Technology</span>\r\n							<h3 class=\"speego-service-title\" style=\"margin-top: 6px;\">The Power of Real-time Order Management Systems (OMS)</h3>\r\n							<p class=\"speego-service-text\">Why end-to-end milestone visibility across maritime cargo and trucking is transforming modern supply chain resilience.</p>\r\n							<a href=\"news/index.html\" class=\"speego-service-link\"><span>Read Analysis</span><svg class=\"speego-serv