s\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></div>\r\n							<div class=\"speego-trust-logo-item\"><img class=\"speego-trust-logo-img\" src=\"assets/logos-partners/020-image-7.png\" alt=\"Global Logistics Partner\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></div>\r\n							<div class=\"speego-trust-logo-item\"><img class=\"speego-trust-logo-img\" src=\"assets/logos-partners/021-image-3.png\" alt=\"International Cargo Network\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></div>\r\n						</div>\r\n					</div>\r\n				</div>\r\n			</div>\r\n		</section>\r\n\r\n		<!-- =================================================================\r\n		     6/ ĐÁNH GIÁ (TESTIMONIALS)\r\n		     ================================================================= -->\r\n		<section class=\"speego-section speego-testimonial-section\" id=\"testimonials-speego\">\r\n			<div class=\"speego-testimonial-inner\">\r\n				<div class=\"speego-testimonial-header\">\r\n					<h2 class=\"speego-testimonial-title\" data-i18n=\"testi_title\">What Global Business Leaders Say</h2>\r\n				</div>\r\n\r\n				<div class=\"speego-testimonial-grid\">\r\n				<article class=\"speego-testimonial-card\">\r\n					<div class=\"speego-testi-stars\" aria-hidden=\"true\">★★★★★</div>\r\n					<blockquote class=\"speego-testi-quote\">\r\n						SpeeGo Logistics helped us source nail salon accessories and custom packaging directly from Vietnam factories. Their on-site QC team saved us thousands of dollars before containers were sealed.\r\n					</blockquote>\r\n					<footer class=\"speego-testi-author\">\r\n						<div class=\"speego-testi-avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">KL</div>\r\n						<div class=\"speego-testi-meta\">\r\n							<div class=\"speego-testi-name\">Kevin Le</div>\r\n							<div class=\"speego-testi-role\">CEO, Glamour Nail Supplies · California, USA</div>\r\n						</div>\r\n					</footer>\r\n				</article>\r\n\r\n				<article class=\"speego-testimonial-card\">\r\n					<div class=\"speego-testi-stars\" aria-hidden=\"true\">★★★★★</div>\r\n					<blockquote class=\"speego-testi-quote\">\r\n						The real-time OMS tracking and zero-hidden-costs policy make SpeeGo our most reliable supply chain partner. We ship 4-6 full containers monthly to Sydney without customs hiccups.\r\n					</blockquote>\r\n					<footer class=\"speego-testi-author\">\r\n						<div class=\"speego-testi-avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">SM</div>\r\n						<div class=\"speego-testi-meta\">\r\n							<div class=\"speego-testi-name\">Sarah Mitchell</div>\r\n							<div class=\"speego-testi-role\">Operations Director, EcoLiving Home · Melbourne, Australia</div>\r\n						</div>\r\n					</footer>\r\n				</article>\r\n\r\n				<article class=\"speego-testimonial-card\">\r\n					<div class=\"speego-testi-stars\" aria-hidden=\"true\">★★★★★</div>\r\n					<blockquote class=\"speego-testi-quote\">\r\n						We consolidated raw cosmetics materials from Guangzhou and finished goods packaging in Ho Chi Minh City. SpeeGo handled the complex customs clearance into Vancouver effortlessly.\r\n					</blockquote>\r\n					<footer class=\"speego-testi-author\">\r\n						<div class=\"speego-testi-avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">DT</div>\r\n						<div class=\"speego-testi-meta\">\r\n							<div class=\"speego-testi-name\">David Tran</div>\r\n							<div class=\"speego-testi-role\">Co-Founder, PureGlow Beauty Inc. · Vancouver, Canada</div>\r\n						</div>\r\n					</footer>\r\n				</article>\r\n			</div>\r\n			<div class=\"speego-testimonial-dots\" role=\"status\" aria-label=\"Số lượng nhận xét\">\r\n				<span class=\"speego-testimonial-dot is-active\" aria-label=\"Nhận xét 1\" aria-current=\"true\"></span>\r\n				<span class=\"speego-testimonial-dot\" aria-label=\"Nhận xét 2\"></span>\r\n				<span class=\"speego-testimonial-dot\" aria-label=\"Nhận xét 3\"></span>\r\n			</div>\r\n		</div>\r\n		</section>\r\n\r\n		<!-- =================================================================\r\n		     7/ VÌ SAO CHỌN SPEEGO? (6 PILLARS)\r\n		     ================================================================= -->\r\n		<section class=\"speego-why-section\" id=\"why-speego\">\r\n			<div class=\"speego-why-inner\">\r\n				<header class=\"speego-why-header\">\r\n					<span class=\"speego-why-accent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\r\n					<h2 class=\"speego-why-title\" data-i18n=\"why_title\">TẠI SAO NÊN CHỌN SPEEGO LOGISTICS</h2>\r\n					<p class=\"speego-why-subtitle\" data-i18n=\"why_subtitle\">\r\n						Cam kết giá trị minh bạch, hạ tầng đồng bộ và đội ngũ chuyên gia tận tâm.\r\n					</p>\r\n				</header>\r\n\r\n				<div class=\"speego-why-container\">\r\n					<div class=\"speego-why-grid\">\r\n						<article class=\"speego-why-cell\">\r\n							<span class=\"speego-why-cell-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M9.5 6C6.5 7.6 5 10 5 12.8c0 2 1.2 3.4 3 3.4 1.6 0 2.7-1.1 2.7-2.6 0-1.4-1-2.4-2.3-2.4-.2 0-.4 0-.5.1.3-1.6 1.6-3 3.3-3.9L9.5 6Zm9 0c-3 1.6-4.5 4-4.5 6.8 0 2 1.2 3.4 3 3.4 1.6 0 2.7-1.1 2.7-2.6 0-1.4-1-2.4-2.3-2.4-.2 0-.4 0-.5.1.3-1.6 1.6-3 3.3-3.9L18.5 6Z\"/></svg></span>\r\n							<h3 class=\"speego-why-cell-title\" data-i18n=\"why1_title\">Chuỗi cung ứng đa lĩnh vực</h3>\r\n							<p class=\"speego-why-cell-desc\" data-i18n=\"why1_desc\">Đáp ứng nhu cầu sản xuất và vận chuyển quốc tế cho doanh nghiệp.</p>\r\n						</article>\r\n						<article class=\"speego-why-cell\">\r\n							<span class=\"speego-why-cell-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M9.5 6C6.5 7.6 5 10 5 12.8c0 2 1.2 3.4 3 3.4 1.6 0 2.7-1.1 2.7-2.6 0-1.4-1-2.4-2.3-2.4-.2 0-.4 0-.5.1.3-1.6 1.6-3 3.3-3.9L9.5 6Zm9 0c-3 1.6-4.5 4-4.5 6.8 0 2 1.2 3.4 3 3.4 1.6 0 2.7-1.1 2.7-2.6 0-1.4-1-2.4-2.3-2.4-.2 0-.4 0-.5.1.3-1.6 1.6-3 3.3-3.9L18.5 6Z\"/></svg></span>\r\n							<h3 class=\"speego-why-cell-title\" data-i18n=\"why2_title\">Mạng lưới nhà máy rộng khắp TQ, VN</h3>\r\n							<p class=\"speego-why-cell-desc\" data-i18n=\"why2_desc\">Kết nối đối tác, nhà máy và xưởng